<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1CO" style="id">1</book>
  <para style="h">Korɛnti Fɔlɔ Suran</para>
  <para style="toc3">1CO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Korɛnti Fɔlɔman</para>
  <para style="toc2">1KO</para>
  <para style="mt1">Kitabu Fɔlɔ Kɔrɛntikailu Ma</para>
  <para style="mt2">Pɔli la Alla la Kuma Kitabu Fɔlɔman Kɔrɛntikailu Ma</para>
  <para style="ip">Pɔli la kelaya taama filanan, a ka karo tan ni seyin kɛ Kɛrɛkiilu wara Korɛnti so kɔndɔ. A ka lemɛniya jama ladɛn mɛn damira ye, wo mɔɔilu kɛnin tɛrɛ siya gbɛrɛilu le ri mɛnilu tɛrɛ joo batola.</para>
  <para style="ip">Wo waati rɔ Korɛnti so sabatinin tɛrɛ haan, ka fara a kulun lɔdiya filailu la. Julaya sabatinin tɛrɛ haan! Namun koilu fanan sabatinin tɛrɛ. Dunuɲa walijiya karan ni joo bato koilu fanan sabatinin tɛrɛ. Kojuu ni sɔn juu fanan waranin tɛrɛ. Wo rɔ, wo koilu tɛrɛ lemɛniya jama kura tɔrɔfɛ, woilu tɛrɛ ii masamanna ɲa bɛɛ ma. An ye a yenna le wo rɔ ko wo ka kɔndafili siyaman bila le keladen na.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pɔli bɔ kɔrɔ ye, a ka kɔndafili ko siyaman mɛn ka bɛn ye mɔɔilu la lemɛniya jama ma. Wo rɔ, a ka kitabu sɛbɛ haan naanin ɲɔɔn. Fila tɛrɛ woilu tɛma mɛnilu lamaranin Kitabu kɔndɔ. Kɔni a tɔ fila mɛnilu tɛ an bolo bi butun, woilu la ko fɔnin Kɔrɛntikailu la Kitabuilu kɔndɔ a Fɔlɔman, ka bɔ a suran 5 kuma diya 9 haan 13. Ii la ko fɔnin a kitabu filanan fanan kɔndɔ a suran 2 kuma diya 3 a ni a suran 7 kuma diya 8. Kitabu fila mɛnilu ye Kitabu kɔndɔ, woilu sɛbɛnin Pɔli la kelaya taama sawanan de rɔ, a fɔlɔ sɛbɛnin Efɛsi so le kɔndɔ (a ragbɛ Kɔrɛntikailu la Kitabu Fɔlɔ suran 16 kuma diya 8), a filanan sɛbɛnin Efɛsi so le kɔndɔ wala Masedoniya.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabu fɔlɔ kɔndɔ mɛn sɛbɛra Kɔrɛntikailu ma, a ban kɔrɔ tuwali kɛla, a ka waliɲuma lɔn kɛ Alla matara rɔ (suran 1 kuma diya 1 haan 9), Pɔli ka a fɔ ye mɔɔilu yɛ, ko ii ye latalali ban mɛn ye ii tɛma (suran 1 kuma diya 10 haan suran 4 kuma diya 21), ka kojuu ban jama rɔ (suran 5), ka fara ii la koilu lasela siya gbɛrɛilu la kitila diyailu rɔ (suran 6 kuma diya 1 haan 11). A ye a yirakala fanan lemɛniya mɔɔilu ka kan ka ii faribanku labaara ɲa mɛn ma (suran 6 kuma diya 12 haan 20). Wo kɔ rɔ, a ka ye mɔɔilu la maɲininkali siyaman jabi, ka bɛn ko ɲinilu ma:</para>
  <para style="ip">Furu la ko (suran 7)</para>
  <para style="ip">Sobo la ko mɛn bɔnin sarakaya la jooilu yɛ, a ni mɔɔ ka kan ka a jɛrɛ mira ɲa mɛn ma ka bɛn joo bato koilu ni namun kɔrɔilu ma (suran 8 kuma diya 1 haan suran 11 kuma diya 1)</para>
  <para style="ip">Lemɛniya jama ladɛn ni Maari la dɔɔnnin na ko (suran 11 kuma diya 2 haan 34)</para>
  <para style="ip">Alla la Nii Sɛniman na niilifenilu la ko (suran 12 haan 14)</para>
  <para style="ip">Mɔɔ faaninilu wuli ko saya rɔ (suran 15)</para>
  <para style="ip">Sɛbɛ labannin kibaro do le ma ikomin keladen baarailu ni tuwaliilu (suran 16). Dunuɲa kɔndafili ko ɲinilu bɛɛ rɔ, keladen ye a yirakala le ko Isa ri se mɔɔilu la kɔndafili koilu bɔla ii ma ɲa mɛn ma, ko a la kaninteya le sila ri mɛn taminin ko bɛɛ la (suran 13).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CO 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 1:1" />Nde Pɔli, Alla ka mɛn kili a sawo rɔ, ka n kɛ Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin na talibidenba ri, n ni an badenma Sɔsitɛni le ɲin sɛbɛla ai ma, <verse eid="1CO 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 1:2" />ka a lawa Alla la lemɛniya jama ma Korɛnti so kɔndɔ, mɔɔ mɛnilu ra lasɛninya Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin baraka rɔ, mɛnilu kilinin kosa ii ye kɛ jama sɛniman di, a ni mɔɔ mɛnilu bɛɛ ye Alla matarala yɔrɔ bɛɛ rɔ an Maari Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin tɔɔ rɔ, ii Maari, a ni an fanan ta.<verse eid="1CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 1:3" />An Fa Alla ni an Maari Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin ye hina ni jususuma di ai ma.<verse eid="1CO 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Baraka Bila Alla yɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 1:4" />N ye baraka bilala Alla yɛ ai la ko rɔ waati bɛɛ ka a masɔrɔn a ra hina ai la Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin baraka rɔ. <verse eid="1CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 1:5" />Baa ai la koilu bɛɛ ra sabati Isa baraka rɔ, ai la kuma ni ai la lɔnnin bɛɛ, <verse eid="1CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 1:6" />ka a masɔrɔn an na sereya ra yiraka ai fɛ fewu Ɲenematɔmɔnin na ko rɔ. <verse eid="1CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 1:7" />Wo rɔ, Alla la sɔlifen si dɛsɛnin tɛ ai ma ai wa kɛ an Maari Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin makɔnɔnna haan a ye bɔ kɛnɛma. <verse eid="1CO 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 1:8" />A ri ai lamara fanan fewu, haan waati laban kosa an Maari Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin kana fɛɛ si tɛrɛn ai la a na Lon. <verse eid="1CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 1:9" />Alla mɛn ka ai kili kosa ai ni an Maari Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin ye bɛn ai ɲɔɔn ma, wo telennin.<verse eid="1CO 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bɛnbaliya lemɛniya jama rɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 1:10" />N badenmailu, n ye ai madiyala an Maari Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin tɔɔ rɔ, ai bɛɛ ye bɛn ai ɲɔɔn ma, kosa ai kana latalan, kosa ai ye kɛ kelen di, ai miriyailu ni ai kɔndɔ koilu ye kɛ kelen di. <verse eid="1CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 1:11" />N badenmailu, n da a lɔn Kilowe wara mɔɔilu fɛ, ko bɛnbaliya ye ai tɛma. <verse eid="1CO 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 1:12" />N ye a fɛ ka mɛn fɔ, wo le ten: mɔɔ doilu ye a fɔla ai tɛma ko, «Nde ye Pɔli le kɔfɛ »; do ko, «Nde ye Apɔlɔsi le kɔfɛ»; do fanan ko, «Nde ye Sefasi le kɔfɛ»; do gbɛrɛ fanan ko, «Nde ye Ɲenematɔmɔnin de kɔfɛ.» <verse eid="1CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 1:13" />Ɲenematɔmɔnin latalannin de a ri wa? Pɔli le gbɔngbɔnda jiri kan ai yɛ wa? Ai sunnin ji rɔ Pɔli le tɔɔ rɔ wa?<verse eid="1CO 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 1:14" />N ye baraka bilala Alla yɛ ko n ma ai foyi sun ji rɔ fɔɔ Kiripusi ni Kayusi <verse eid="1CO 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 1:15" />kosa mɔɔ si kana a fɔ ko ai sunnin ji rɔ n tɔɔ le rɔ. <verse eid="1CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 1:16" />N tɛrɛ ra Esitefana ni a wara mɔɔilu fanan sun ji rɔ. Kɔni n ma a lɔn butun ni n da mɔɔ gbɛrɛ sun ji rɔ. <verse eid="1CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 1:17" />Ɲenematɔmɔnin ma n kelaya, ko n ye sun ji rɔ kɛ. A ka n kelaya le, ko n ye wa Isa la ko Kibaro Ɲuma lase, adon, n tɛ wo kɛla adamadenilu la waliji kumailu fɛ kosa Ɲenematɔmɔnin na saya ko fanka kana bɔ a la wo rɔ.<verse eid="1CO 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Walijiya ni hankilitanya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 1:18" />Baa kelaya mɛn fɔnin ai yɛ, Isa faa ko jiri kan, wo kɛnin hankilidɔɔya le ri mɔɔilu yɛ mɛnilu ye halakila. Kɔni Alla ye andeilu mɛnilu lakisila, a kɛnin Alla fanka le ri andeilu yɛ. <verse eid="1CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 1:19" />Baa ɲin de sɛbɛnin Kitabu rɔ: «N di walijiilu la walijiya tiɲan, ka hankilimailu la hankilimaya rabasan.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">1.19</char> Esayi suran 29 kuma diya 14.</note> <verse eid="1CO 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 1:20" />Waliji ye min? Sariya karanmɔɔ ye min? Waati ɲin lɔnninna ye min? Alla ma dunuɲa mɔɔilu la walijiya kɛ ii ma fatɔya le ri wa?<verse eid="1CO 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 1:21" />Baa Alla, Alla la walijiya rɔ, a ma sɔn dunuɲa mɔɔilu ye a lɔn ii la walijiya rɔ. A ka Alla hɛnɛn de a ye mɔɔ lemɛniyaniilu lakisi kawandili ɲin fɛ mɛn kɛnin ikomin fatɔya jama yɛ. <verse eid="1CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 1:22" />Judiyailu ye tɔɔmasereilu maɲininkala, Kirɛkiilu ye walijiya ɲininna. <verse eid="1CO 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 1:23" />Kɔni Ɲenematɔmɔnin gbɔngbɔn ko jiri kan, an ye wo le la ko kawandili bɔla. Judiyailu tɛ sɔnna wo le mɛnna, a ni kɔmɔɔya le wo ri siya gbɛrɛilu yɛ. <verse eid="1CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 1:24" />Kɔni Alla ra mɛnilu kili, ni a kɛra Judiya ri wala Kirɛki, Ɲenematɔmɔnin kɛnin Alla fanka ni a la walijiya le ri, wo tiilu yɛ. <verse eid="1CO 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 1:25" />Baa hali Alla la ko doilu ni hankilidɔɔya munuɲanin, wo hankilidɔɔya taminnin mɔɔilu la walijiya la. Hali Alla la ko doilu ni fankatanɲa munuɲanin, wo fankatanɲa ka bon mɔɔilu fanka ri.<verse eid="1CO 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 1:26" />N badenmailu, ai ye ai miri a ma, ai kɛnin tɛrɛ mɔɔ su mɛnilu ri Alla ka ai kili waati mɛn na. Waliji siyaman tɛrɛ tɛ ai tɛma adamadenilu ɲakɔrɔ. Fankama siyaman tɛrɛ tɛ ai tɛma, denbaya barakanin siyaman tɛrɛ tɛ ai tɛma. <verse eid="1CO 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 1:27" />Kɔni mɛn na ko kɛnin hankilidɔɔya ri dunuɲa mɔɔilu yɛ, Alla ka wo le suwandi ka walijiilu lamaloya. Mɛn kɛnin fankatan di dunuɲa mɔɔilu yɛ, a ka wo le suwandi kosa a ye fankamailu lamaloya. <verse eid="1CO 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 1:28" />Dunuɲa mɔɔilu jonin mɛn ma, ka a bɔrɔbɔ, ii ma mɛn jate fen di, Alla ka wo le suwandi ka dunuɲa namun fenilu halaki, <verse eid="1CO 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 1:29" />kosa adamaden si ti se a jɛrɛ matɔɔla Alla ɲakɔrɔ. <verse eid="1CO 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 1:30" />Ai ye Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin dɔ Alla baraka le rɔ, mɛn ka a kɛ an na waliji ri ka fara Alla la, a ni an na telen ni sɛninya ni kunka. <verse eid="1CO 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 1:31" />Wo le rɔ, ikomin a sɛbɛnin Kitabu kɔndɔ ko, «Ni mɔɔ mɛn ye a jɛrɛ matɔɔla, a ka kan ka a jɛrɛ matɔɔ Maari la ko le rɔ.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">1.31</char> A ragbɛ Jeremiya suran 9 kuma diya 22 haan 23 kɔndɔ.</note><verse eid="1CO 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CO 2" />
  <para style="s">Isa gbɔngbɔn ko jiri kan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 2:1" />N badenmailu, n nara ai tɔrɔfɛ tuma mɛn na, ka Alla la ko sereya bɔ ai yɛ, n ma kuma kɔrɔlaman fɔ ai yɛ walijiya rɔ. <verse eid="1CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 2:2" />Baa n ka a latɛɛ le ko n kana foyi miriya ai tɛma, fɔɔ Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin na ko, a ni ale Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin gbɔngbɔn ko. <verse eid="1CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 2:3" />Nde jɛrɛ tɛrɛ ai tɔrɔfɛ fankatanya rɔ, n tɛrɛ yɛrɛyɛrɛla silan dɔ. <verse eid="1CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 2:4" />N tɛrɛ karan ni kawandili mɛn kɛla, n tɛrɛ tɛ karannin mɔɔilu saman diya adamadenilu la walijiya fɛ, fɔɔ Alla la Nii Sɛniman fanka, <verse eid="1CO 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 2:5" />kosa ai kana lemɛniya adamadenilu la walijiya ma, fɔɔ Alla fanka.<verse eid="1CO 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alla la walijiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 2:6" />Sisɛn mɛnilu la lemɛniya ra rakɔɔ, an ye woilu karanna walijiya do la. Kɔni dunuɲa ɲin walijiya tɛ, wala dunuɲa kuntiilu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">2.6</char> Tumadɔ Pɔli ye kumala <char style="fk">dunuɲa kuntiilu</char> le ma a ni Setana jena mɛnilu ye wo kuntii juuilu fanka ju ri.</note> ta, mɛnilu ye halakila. <verse eid="1CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 2:7" />Ande ye Alla la walijiya gbundu ko le ɲafɔla, mɛn dokonnin, kɔni Alla tun da mɛn natɛɛ an ma an na gbiliya la ko rɔ, sani dunuɲa ye dan. <verse eid="1CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 2:8" />Dunuɲa kuntii si ma wo walijiya lɔn. Ni ii tɛrɛ ka a lɔn, ii tun tɛ Maari gbiliya tii gbɔngbɔnna jiri kan. <verse eid="1CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 2:9" />Kɔni ikomin a sɛbɛnin Kitabu kɔndɔ ɲa mɛn ma ko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">«Alla ka ko mɛnilu rabɛn a kanin mɔɔilu ɲɛrɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">ɲa ma wo yen fɔlɔ, tolo ma wo mɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">mɔɔ ma hankili lamiri mɛn ma fɔlɔ.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">2.9</char> A ragbɛ Esayi suran 64 kuma diya 3 kɔndɔ.</note><verse eid="1CO 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 2:10" />Kɔni Alla ra a yiraka andeilu la a la Nii Sɛniman baraka rɔ. Alla la Nii Sɛniman ye ko bɛɛ kɔrɔ ɲininna hali Alla la gbundu ko dun. <verse eid="1CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 2:11" />Baa yon ye mɔɔilu tɛma mɛn di se mɔɔ kɔnɔrɔ ko lɔnna, ka bɔ a jɛrɛ nii rɔ ko mɛn ye wo tii fari rɔ wa? Wo ɲa ma, mɔɔ si ti se Alla la koilu bɛɛ lɔnna fɔɔ Alla la Nii sɛniman.<verse eid="1CO 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 2:12" />An ma dunuɲa ɲin hankili sɔrɔn, kɔni fɔɔ Alla la Nii Sɛniman, Alla ka mɛn nana, kosa Alla ra fen mɛnilu bɛɛ di an ma gbansan, an ye woilu lɔn. <verse eid="1CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 2:13" />An ye wo koilu le fɔla, mɛnilu kɛnin tɛ mɔɔilu la hankilimaya karanilu ri, kɔni fɔɔ Alla la Nii Sɛniman karan. An ye Alla la Nii koilu ɲafɔla wo tiiilu le yɛ, wo Nii ye mɛnilu rɔ. <verse eid="1CO 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 2:14" />Kɔni Alla la Nii Sɛniman tɛ mɔɔ mɛn dɔ, wo tii tɛ Alla la Nii koilu mirala fewu. Kɔmɔɔya koilu le woilu ri a ɲakɔrɔ, a ti se ii famunna. Ka a masɔrɔn Alla la koilu ye lɔnna a la Nii Sɛniman de fɛ. <verse eid="1CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 2:15" />Kɔni, Alla la Nii Sɛniman ye mɔɔ mɛn jusu rɔ, wo tii ri se koilu bɛɛ dan nafarabɔla, kɔni mɔɔ ti se wo tii la ko dan nafarabɔla. <verse eid="1CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 2:16" />Baa a sɛbɛnin Kitabu rɔ ko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:16">«Yon di se Maari miriyailu lɔnna</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:16">kosa a ye a karan?»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">2.16</char> Esayi suran 40 kuma diya 13</note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CO 2:16">Kɔni andeilu, Ɲenematɔmɔnin miriya ye an dɔ.<verse eid="1CO 2:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CO 3" />
  <para style="s">Alla la baarakɛlailu la ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 3:1" />N badenmailu, n tɛrɛ ti se kumala ai yɛ ikomin mɔɔ mɛnilu ra kɔɔ Alla la koilu rɔ, kɔni ikomin dunuɲa mɔɔilu, ikomin mɔɔ mɛnilu ye den ɲɛrɛnninya rɔ Ɲenematɔmɔnin na koilu rɔ. <verse eid="1CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 3:2" />N da karan di ai ma mɛn kɛnin ikomin sin ji, dɔɔnnifen gbɛlɛn tɛrɛ tɛ a ri, baa ai tɛrɛ ti se a lamirala. Kɔni hali sisɛn, ai ti se a nola fɔlɔ. <verse eid="1CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 3:3" />Ka a masɔrɔn ai kɛnin ikomin dunuɲa mɔɔilu. Baa keleya ni bɛnbaliya ye ai tɛma. Wo ra a yiraka ko dunuɲa mɔɔilu le ai ri mɛnilu ye taamanna ikomin adamaden doilu. <verse eid="1CO 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 3:4" />Aile do kelen wa a fɔ ko, «Nde, Pɔli le ta ye n di,» do ye a fɔ ko, «Nde, Apɔlɔsi le ta ye n di,» adamadenya koilu le tɛ woilu ri wa?<verse eid="1CO 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 3:5" />Yon de Apɔlɔsi ri? Yon de Pɔli ri? Alla la baaraden de dɔrɔn ye andeilu ri, mɛnilu ka ai dɛmɛn ai ka lemɛniya. Bɛɛ ri a baara lakanbali Maari ka mɛn don a bolo. <verse eid="1CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 3:6" />N ka si foyi ten, Apɔlɔsi le ka a ji la, kɔni Alla le ka a lasabati. <verse eid="1CO 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 3:7" />Wo ɲa ma, foyi tɛ si foyi mɔɔ ni a ji la mɔɔ ri, fɔɔ Alla mɛn ye a lasabatila. <verse eid="1CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 3:8" />Si foyila ni a ji lala bɛɛ ka kan, Alla ri wo kelen kelenna bɛɛ sara ka bɛn ii baara ɲa ma. <verse eid="1CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 3:9" />Baa an kɛnin baarakɛlailu le ri, mɛnilu ni Alla ye baarala ii ɲɔɔn fɛ. Aile kɛnin Alla la sɛnɛ le ri, Alla la bon. <verse eid="1CO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 3:10" />Alla ra a latɛɛ n ma a la hina rɔ, n ye baara a yɛ ikomin bonlɔla mɛn kusan, bon ju birinna. Sisɛn, mɔɔ gbɛrɛ ye bon lɔla wo kan. Kɔni fɔɔ bɛɛ ye a kɛ a hankili la wo bon lɔ ko rɔ. <verse eid="1CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 3:11" />Baa mɔɔ si ti se bon ju gbɛrɛ ju birinna, baa a ra ban ju birinna. Ɲenematɔmɔnin Isa le a ju birin di. <verse eid="1CO 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 3:12" />Awa, ni mɔɔ si ye bon lɔla wo ju birin kan, ka sanin bon lɔ, wala wodigbɛ, wala kuru dagbɛlɛnilu, wala jiri, wala karatabon, wala bin, <verse eid="1CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 3:13" />bɛɛ baara nɔ ri lɛnkɛnɛmaya Isa Na Lon, baa ta le nala, ka mɔɔ bɛɛ baara nɔ yiraka, ni a ka ɲin, ni a ma ɲin. <verse eid="1CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 3:14" />Ni mɔɔ ra baara kɛ ta tɛ mɛn halakila, wo tii ri a la baraji sɔrɔn. <verse eid="1CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 3:15" />Kɔni ni mɔɔ baara nɔ janinda, a ra bɔnɔ wo rɔ. A jɛrɛ ri kisi, kɔni a ri kɛ ikomin mɔɔ wa tamin ta kun na.<verse eid="1CO 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 3:16" />Ai ma a lɔn wa, ko ai kɛnin Alla batobonba le ri, Alla la Nii Sɛniman sii diya? <verse eid="1CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 3:17" />Wo le rɔ, ni mɔɔ si ka Alla batobonba tiɲan, Alla ri wo tii halaki; baa Alla batobonba sɛniman, aile jɛrɛ le Alla batobonba ri.<verse eid="1CO 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 3:18" />Wo le rɔ, mɔɔ si kana a jɛrɛ majuuwaya. Ni mɔɔ do ye ai tɛma mɛn ye a mirila ko waliji le ale ri dunuɲa mɔɔilu ɲakɔrɔ, a bɛnnin tɛrɛ le, wo tii ye a jɛrɛ jate hankilidɔɔ ri, kosa a ye kɛ waliji jɛrɛ ri. <verse eid="1CO 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 3:19" />Baa dunuɲa walijiya kɛnin kɔmɔɔya le ri Alla ɲakɔrɔ, ikomin a sɛbɛnin Kitabu kɔndɔ ɲa mɛn ma ko, «Alla ye hankilimailu mirala ii jɛrɛ kewuyailu le fɛ.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">3.19</char> A ragbɛ Juba suran 5 kuma diya 13 kɔndɔ.</note> <verse eid="1CO 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 3:20" />A ka a fɔ yɔrɔ gbɛrɛ rɔ fanan ko, «Maari ka walijiilu miriyailu lɔn ko fuuilu le ri.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">3.20</char> Yaburi suran 94 kuma diya 11</note> <verse eid="1CO 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 3:21" />Wo le rɔ, mɔɔ si kana a jɛrɛdabaya adamadenilu la ko rɔ butun! Baa aile ta ye ɲinilu bɛɛ ri: <verse eid="1CO 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 3:22" />nde Pɔli wo, Apɔlɔsi wo, Sefasi wo, dunuɲa ɲin wo, siimaya wala saya, waati ɲin wala mɛn ye nala, ai ta le ii bɛɛ ri, <verse eid="1CO 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 3:23" />a ni Ɲenematɔmɔnin de fanan ta ye aile ri, Alla le fanan ta ye Ɲenematɔmɔnin di.<verse eid="1CO 3:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CO 4" />
  <para style="s">Isa la talibidenilu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 4:1" />Wo rɔ, mɔɔilu ye an jate Ɲenematɔmɔnin na baarakɛlailu le ri, Alla la gbundu koilu karifanin mɛnilu la. <verse eid="1CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 4:2" />Nba, telen de maɲininkanin baaradenilu la. <verse eid="1CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 4:3" />Wo tɛ foyi ri nde yɛ, ni aile ka n na kiti tɛɛ wala adamadenilu la kitila diya do. Nde jɛrɛ ti se n jɛrɛ lakiti tɛɛla, <verse eid="1CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 4:4" />baa n hankili ma n na kiti tɛɛ, kɔni wo tɛ a kɛ ko n telennin. Mɛn ye n makitila, Maari le wo ri. <verse eid="1CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 4:5" />Wo le rɔ, ai kana kiti la sani a waati lanin ye se, sani Maari ye na, mɛn ye dibi ko dokonniilu labɔla kɛnɛma, ka jusu rɔ koilu lɛnkɛnɛmaya. Wo rɔ, bɛɛ ri a la gbiliya sɔrɔn Alla bolo.<verse eid="1CO 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 4:6" />N badenmailu, n ka wo koilu bɛɛ fɔ n jɛrɛ ni Apɔlɔsi ma aile le la ko rɔ kosa an na misali ye sanda ɲin kɔrɔ yiraka ai la ko «Ai kana tamin ko sɛbɛninilu la.» Wo rɔ, ai ti nala wasola, ka mɔɔilu lafisaya ii ɲɔɔn ko. <verse eid="1CO 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 4:7" />Nfen ka ile tamin doilu la? Nfen ye i bolo, mɛn ma don i bolo? Ni a donnin i bolo le, nfenna wo rɔ i ye i jɛrɛ matɔɔla ikomin ile jɛrɛ le ka a sɔrɔn?<verse eid="1CO 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 4:8" />Ai ra wasa jonna! Ai ra kɛ nanfulutiilu ri jonna! Ai ra kɛ mansailu ri wa? A ri diya n yɛ fewu ai tun da kɛ mansailu ri kosa an fanan ye kɛ a ri ai fɛ. <verse eid="1CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 4:9" />Baa n hankili tɛrɛ a ma ko Alla ra andeilu talibidenbailu to kɔma ikomin mɔɔ miranin mɛnilu jalakinin ii ye faa jama ɲa lamaa fen di, an da kɛ ragbɛ fen di dunuɲa mɔɔilu bɛɛ ɲakɔrɔ a ni mɛlɛkailu. <verse eid="1CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 4:10" />Hankilidɔɔ le andeilu ri Ɲenematɔmɔnin na ko rɔ. Kɔni hankilima le aile ri Ɲenematɔmɔnin dɔ. Fanka tɛ andeilu la, kɔni aile, fanka ye aile la. Aile gbiliyanin, kɔni andeilu yarabinin. <verse eid="1CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 4:11" />Haan sisɛn kɔnkɔ ye an na, ji lɔɔ ye an na, feriya ye an na. An ɲakankatannin, jiya diya tɛ an bolo. <verse eid="1CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 4:12" />An ye baara gbɛlɛn kɛla an boloilu la. Ii wa an nanin, an di duwa ii yɛ. Ii wa an ɲakankatan, an di lemɛniya. <verse eid="1CO 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 4:13" />Ii wa an mafɔ, andeilu ri ii lalemɛniya. An da kɛ dunuɲa ɲama duu ta ri ikomin fen kɔsɔnilu haan sisɛn.<verse eid="1CO 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 4:14" />N ma ɲin sɛbɛ ai ma kosa n ye ai lamaloya, kɔni kosa n ye ai lalɔn ikomin n kaninte denilu. <verse eid="1CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 4:15" />Baa hali karanmɔɔ waa tan (10,000) lɔnin tɛrɛ ai ɲɛrɔ mɛnilu ye ai karanna Ɲenematɔmɔnin na ko rɔ, fa siyaman tɛ ai la, baa n da kɛ ai fa ri Ɲenematɔmɔnin Isa la ko rɔ, a la ko Kibaro Ɲuma la ko kosɔn. <verse eid="1CO 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 4:16" />Wo le rɔ, n ye ai madiyala, ai ye n nadɛn. <verse eid="1CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 4:17" />N ka Timote lawa ai ma wo le rɔ. N diyanan dencɛ le a ri a ni lemɛniya mɔɔ Maari la ko rɔ. A ri n na silailu labila ai la Ɲenematɔmɔnin Isa la ko rɔ, n ye lemɛniya jamailu bɛɛ karanna mɛnilu la yɔrɔ bɛɛ rɔ.<verse eid="1CO 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 4:18" />Aile doilu ye ai jɛrɛdabayala, ikomin n tɛ nala ai tɔrɔfɛ. <verse eid="1CO 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 4:19" />Kɔni ni Maari sɔnda, n di na ai tɔrɔfɛ sisɛn. Wo rɔ, n di na wo mɔɔ wasoninilu fanka lɔn diya, wala ni ii ye kumala gbansan. <verse eid="1CO 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 4:20" />Baa kuma tɛ Alla la mansaya ri, fɔɔ fanka. <verse eid="1CO 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 4:21" />Nfen duman ai yɛ? N ye na bonsan di ai ɲɛrɔ? Wala kaninteya ni ɲumaya?<verse eid="1CO 4:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CO 5" />
  <para style="s">Jalonya la ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 5:1" />Nba, ii ye a fɔla ko mɔɔ do ye kaninkɛla ai tɛma. Wo kaninkɛ ɲa juuman kosɛbɛ, hali lemɛniyabaliilu tɛ wo su kɛla. Mɔɔ do ra a na dɔɔnin ta. <verse eid="1CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 5:2" />Hali wo, ai ye ai wasola! A bɛnnin tɛrɛ, ai ye sunun wo rɔ. Mɔɔ mɛn wa ko su wo kɛ, ai ye wo bɔ ai tɛma. <verse eid="1CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 5:3" />Hali n faribanku tɛ ai tɔrɔfɛ kɔni n hankili ye ai ko. Mɔɔ mɛn da wo ko su kɛ, n da ban wo tii jalakila ikomin n tɛrɛ wa kɛ ai tɔrɔfɛ. <verse eid="1CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 5:4" />Ai wa ai ladɛn Maari Isa tɔɔ rɔ, n fanan hankili ye ai ko, Maari Isa fanka fanan ye ai fɛ, <verse eid="1CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 5:5" />wo waati rɔ, ai ye wo tii gbɛn ai tɛma, ka a to Setana bolo, a faribanku diyanan koilu tiɲan kanma, kosa a nii ri kisi Maari Na Lon.<verse eid="1CO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 5:6" />Ai la jɛrɛ matɔɔ ma ɲin muumɛ! Ai ma a lɔn wa, ko «Lɛbɛn<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">5.6</char> <char style="fk">buru layɛlɛ fen:</char> Lɛbɛn de wo ri mɛn ye buru lawarala ka tamin. </note> dɔɔnin di dɛɛba bɛɛ layɛlɛ?» <verse eid="1CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 5:7" />Wo rɔ, ai ye ai jɛrɛ lasɛninya! Ai ye hakɛ bɔ ai tɛma mɛn tonin ai tɛma ikomin lɛbɛn kɔrɔ buru kun na. Ai kɛnin de ikomin buru kura lɛbɛn tɛ mɛn na. Baa Ɲenematɔmɔnin da faa an yɛ ikomin Taminkunna<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">5.7</char> <char style="fk">Taminkunna Sali:</char> Musa la waati rɔ, Alla ka fitinna ko lana Ferawuna la jama ma, mɛlɛka nara ii den fɔlɔilu bɛɛ faa su kelen dɔ. Kɔni, Isirayɛlikailu ka saraka jeli sadisadi ii la bonilu da jiriilu ma, saya mɛlɛka taminda ii kun na. Wo ko sali le ɲin di. A ragbɛ Hɔrɔya suran 12 kuma diya 1 haan 13 kɔndɔ.</note> saraka saa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">5.7</char> A ragbɛ Hɔrɔya suran 13 kuma diya 7 ni suran 12 kuma diya 21 kɔndɔ.</note> <verse eid="1CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 5:8" />Wo rɔ, an ye wo sali kɛ a ɲa ma. An kana wo sali kɛ buru layɛlɛ fen kɔrɔ la, mɛn kɛnin ikomin lagboyaɲɛ ni ko juu. Kɔni an yɛ wo sali kɛ ikomin buru layɛlɛ fen tɛ basannin buru mɛn na, sɛninya ni tuɲa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">5.8</char> A ragbɛ Hɔrɔya suran 12 kuma diya 15 haan 20 ni Sariyailu suran 16 kuma diya 3 kɔndɔ.</note><verse eid="1CO 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 5:9" />N ka wo sɛbɛ le ai ma n na bataki kɔndɔ, ko ai kana ai ni jalonilu ladɛn. <verse eid="1CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 5:10" />Kɔni n tɛ a fɔla dunuɲa ɲin mɔɔilu le la ko la, mɛnilu ye jalonya kɛla, wala wasabali wala kansontenilu wala joo batolailu. Ni a ye wo ɲa le ma, fɔɔ ai ye bɔ dunuɲa rɔ fewu! <verse eid="1CO 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 5:11" />Sisɛn, n ye wo sɛbɛla ai ma ko, mɔɔ mɛnilu ra ii jɛrɛ kɛ lemɛniya mɔɔilu ri, kɔni ii ye tola jalonya kɛla, wala wasabaliya, wala joo bato, wala nafiya, wala dɔlɔ min wala kansonya. Hali ai ni woilu kana ai bolo ladɛn dɔɔnnin diya. <verse eid="1CO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 5:12" />Baa, nde la baara le wa, ka lemɛniyabaliilu kiti? Aile ma kan ka lemɛniya jama mɔɔilu kiti wa? <verse eid="1CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 5:13" />Alla le lemɛniyabaliilu la kitiilu tɛɛla. A sɛbɛnin Kitabu rɔ ko, «Ai ye mɔɔ juu gbɛn ai tɛma.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">5.13</char> Sariyailu suran 17 kuma diya 7</note><verse eid="1CO 5:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CO 6" />
  <para style="s">Kiti lemɛniyamɔɔilu tɛma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 6:1" />Ni kɛlɛ ye mɔɔ fila tɛma lemɛniya jama rɔ, nfenna ai ye susula wo kiti ye la telenbaliilu tɛma, sani a ye la jama sɛniman tɛma? <verse eid="1CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 6:2" />Ai ma a lɔn wa, ko jama sɛniman de dunuɲa kiti tɛɛla? Nba, ni ai ye dunuɲa kitiilu tɛɛla, nfenna ai ti se ko dɔɔmanninilu kiti tɛɛla? <verse eid="1CO 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 6:3" />Ai ma a lɔn wa ko andeilu le mɛlɛkailu makitila? An di kaɲa dunuɲa ɲin koilu ma wo rɔ wa? <verse eid="1CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 6:4" />Nba, ni kɛlɛilu ye ai tɛma dunuɲa koilu rɔ, ai ri mɔɔilu kɛ kititɛɛlailu ri wo rɔ wa gbiliya tɛ mɛnilu kan lemɛniya jama tɛma? <verse eid="1CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 6:5" />N ye ai maloya ko le fɔla wo rɔ. Waliji si tɛ ai tɛma wa mɛn di se lemɛniya mɔɔ fila tɛma kiti tɛɛla? <verse eid="1CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 6:6" />Kɔni lemɛniya mɔɔ do ra a badenma do kili kiti ma lemɛniyabaliilu ɲakɔrɔ!<verse eid="1CO 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 6:7" />Ni kitiilu ye ai tɛma, bɔnɔ le wo ri. Yani wo ye kɛ, a bɛnnin tɛrɛ tɛ wa, ai ye sɔn telenbaliya ye kɛ ai la wo rɔ? Wo rɔ, ai tɛrɛ ma kan ka sɔn kansonya ma wa? <verse eid="1CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 6:8" />Fɔɔ aile jɛrɛ le telenbaliya kɛla, ka ai badenmailu bolofenilu kansonya. <verse eid="1CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 6:9" />Ai ma a lɔn wa ko telenbaliilu ti nala cɛ sɔrɔnna Alla la mansaya rɔ? Ai kana ai jɛrɛ majuuwaya. Jalonilu wala joo batolailu wala kaninkɛlailu wala cɛɛ mɛnilu ye laɲɔɔya kɛla ii ɲɔɔn na, <verse eid="1CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 6:10" />wala sonilu wala wasabaliilu wala dɔlɔ minnailu, wala nafiilu, wala kansontenilu, woilu foyi tɛ cɛ sɔrɔnna Alla la mansaya rɔ. <verse eid="1CO 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 6:11" />Aile doilu tɛrɛ wo ɲa le ma, kɔni ai ra ai ko ka ai la kojuu bɔ ai ma, ka lasɛninya, ka kɛ mɔɔ telenninilu ri an Maari Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin tɔɔ rɔ a ni Alla la Nii Sɛniman baraka rɔ.<verse eid="1CO 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ai ye Alla gbiliya ai faribanku rɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 6:12" />«Ko bɛɛ dahanin nde ma.» Kɔni tɔnɔ tɛ ko bɛɛ la. «Ko bɛɛ dahanin nde ma.» Kɔni nde ti nala sɔnna kɛla foyi la jɔn di. <verse eid="1CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 6:13" />«Kɔnɔ le ta ye dɔɔnnifen di, dɔɔnnifen de fanan ta ye kɔnɔ ri.» Kɔni Alla ri ii fila bɛɛ halaki. Mɔɔ faribanku ladannin tɛ jalonya kanma, kɔni Maari le ta ye faribanku ri, a ni Maari fanan ye faribanku le yɛ. <verse eid="1CO 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 6:14" />Nba, Alla ra Maari lawuli saya rɔ, a ri andeilu fanan nawuli a fanka la. <verse eid="1CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 6:15" />Ai ma a lɔn ko ai faribanku kɛnin Ɲenematɔmɔnin faribanku yɔrɔ do le ri wa? Wo rɔ, n ka kan ka Maari faribanku maa jatɔ fari la wa? Ɛɛn de! <verse eid="1CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 6:16" />Ai ma a lɔn wa ko cɛɛ mɛn ni jatɔ muso ye kafula, ko woilu ra kɛ faribanku kelen di? Baa a sɛbɛnin Kitabu rɔ ko: «Woilu fila ri kɛ faribanku kelen di.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">6.16</char> A Damira suran 2 kuma diya 24</note> <verse eid="1CO 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 6:17" />Kɔni mɛn ye a jɛrɛ tuunna Maari la, wo nii ni Maari nii ra kɛ kelen di.<verse eid="1CO 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 6:18" />Ai ye ai bori jalonya kɔrɔ. Mɔɔ ye hakɛ gbɛrɛ mɛnilu bɛɛ kɛla woilu tɛ a faribanku rɔ, kɔni mɔɔ mɛn ye jalonya kɛla wo ye hakɛ kɛla a jɛrɛ faribanku le kanma. <verse eid="1CO 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 6:19" />Ai ma a lɔn wa ko ai faribanku ye Alla la Nii Sɛniman batobon de ri, Nii mɛn ye ai rɔ, Alla ka mɛn di ai ma? Ai ta tɛ ai jɛrɛ ri. <verse eid="1CO 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 6:20" />Baa a ka ai kunka sɔnkɔ gbɛlɛn de la. Wo rɔ, ai ye Alla gbiliya ai faribanku rɔ.<verse eid="1CO 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CO 7" />
  <para style="s">Furu ko ɲininkali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 7:1" />Ai ka mɛn fɔ ai la sɛbɛ kɔndɔ, an ye na wo ma ko ni a ri bɛn cɛɛ ni muso kana laɲɔɔya kɛ. <verse eid="1CO 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 7:2" />Baa, jalonya ye siyayala, a bɛnnin cɛɛ bɛɛ ye muso kelen furu a jɛrɛ yɛ. Cɛɛ bɛɛ la muso ye to a bolo, muso bɛɛ la cɛɛ ye to a bolo. <verse eid="1CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 7:3" />Cɛɛ ka kan ka mɛn kɛ a muso yɛ, a ye wo kɛ a yɛ. Muso fanan ye wo ɲa le ma a la cɛɛ ma. <verse eid="1CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 7:4" />Muso sawo tɛ a jɛrɛ faribanku rɔ fɔɔ a la cɛɛ. Wo ɲa ma, cɛɛ fanan sawo tɛ a jɛrɛ faribanku rɔ fɔɔ a la muso. <verse eid="1CO 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 7:5" />Ai kana ai ban ai ɲɔɔn bolo fɔɔ ni ai fila ra bɛn waati do ma Alla matara ko rɔ. Wo kɔ rɔ, ai ri dɛn ikɔ tuunnin kosa Setana ti nala ai lafilila ai la jɛrɛ mirabaliya rɔ.<verse eid="1CO 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 7:6" />N sɔnnin mɛn ma n ye wo le fɔla wo ri. A kɛnin tɛ jamarili ri. <verse eid="1CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 7:7" />N tɛrɛ ye a fɛ le, bɛɛ ye kɛ muso tabali ri ikomin nde, kɔni bɛɛ ni a la dinmalifen de Alla bolo. Do wa ɲin sɔrɔn, do fanan di gbɛrɛ sɔrɔn.<verse eid="1CO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 7:8" />Nba, mɛnilu furunin tɛ a ni cɛsamusoilu, n ye ɲin de fɔla woilu la ko rɔ. A bɛnnin ii ye to ii danna ikomin nde. <verse eid="1CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 7:9" />Kɔni ni ii ti se ii jɛrɛ mirala, ii ka kan ka furu kɛ, baa wo ka fisa sani ii ye to kunfan ba rɔ.<verse eid="1CO 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 7:10" />Nba, mɛnilu furunin, n ye jamarili ɲin dila woilu le la ko rɔ. Nde tɛ fɔɔ Maari. Muso kana a ban a la cɛɛ rɔ. <verse eid="1CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 7:11" />Ni a ka a ban a la cɛɛ rɔ, a kana sii cɛɛ gbɛrɛ kun. Wala, a ni a la cɛɛ tɛmala ye rabɛn. Cɛɛ fanan kana a ban a la muso rɔ.<verse eid="1CO 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 7:12" />N ye ɲin de fɔla mɔɔ doilu yɛ. Nde le a fɔla, Maari la kuma tɛ wo ri. Ni muso lemɛniyabali do ye cɛɛ lemɛniyanin do bolo, ni muso sɔnda ko ii ye to ii ɲɔɔn fɛ, cɛɛ wo ma kan ka a ban a rɔ. <verse eid="1CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 7:13" />Ni muso lemɛniyanin do siinin cɛɛ lemɛniyabali do kunma, ni cɛɛ sɔnda ko ii ye to ii ɲɔɔn fɛ, muso ma kan ka a ban a rɔ. <verse eid="1CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 7:14" />Baa cɛɛ lemɛniyabali tɛrɛ ra lasɛninya a muso fɛ. Wo ɲa ma muso lemɛniyabali fanan tɛrɛ ra lasɛninya a la cɛɛ lemɛniyanin fɛ. Ni wo tɛrɛ tɛ a ri, ai denilu tun di kɛ mɔɔ sɛninyabaliilu ri, adon tuɲa ye mɛn di ii lasɛninyanin. <verse eid="1CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 7:15" />Kɔni ni lemɛniyabali ye a ban ko rɔ a la cɛɛ rɔ wala a la muso rɔ, a to a ye wa. Lemɛniya mɔɔ sidinin tɛ wo rɔ butun a wa kɛ cɛɛ ri wala muso. Ka a masɔrɔn Alla ka an kili jususuma le rɔ. <verse eid="1CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 7:16" />Baa ile muso, i ye a lɔnna di, ni i ri se i la cɛɛ lakisila? Ile cɛɛ, i ye a lɔnna di, ni i ri se i la muso lakisila?<verse eid="1CO 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bɛɛ ye to Alla la ko latɛɛnin dɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 7:17" />Ka bɔ wo la, bɛɛ ye to a ɲa ma ikomin Maari ka a latɛɛ a ma ɲa mɛn ma Alla ka a kili waati mɛn na. N ye jamarili ɲin de donna lemɛniya jamailu bɛɛ bolo. <verse eid="1CO 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 7:18" />Ikomin misali ɲinilu: Ni cɛɛ do tɛrɛ ra faaninta kɛ Alla ka a kili waati mɛn na, a kana a la kanberenya dokon. Kɔni ni do gbɛrɛ tɛrɛ ma faaninta kɛ sani Alla ye a kili, a kana sɔn butun, a ye faaninta kɛ. <verse eid="1CO 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 7:19" />Ni i ra faaninta kɛ, ni i ma faaninta kɛ, foyi tɛ wo ri fɔɔ i ye Alla la jamariliilu le mira. <verse eid="1CO 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 7:20" />Bɛɛ ye to wo ɲa kelen ma ikomin a tɛrɛ ɲa mɛn ma a ka a kili waati mɛn na. <verse eid="1CO 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 7:21" />A ka i kili waati mɛn na, ni jɔn de tɛrɛ ile ri, i kana hamin wo rɔ. Kɔni ni i ri se fɛrɛ sɔrɔnna ka i kanhɔrɔya, wo kɛ. <verse eid="1CO 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 7:22" />Baa Maari ra jɔn mɛn kili, Maari la hɔrɔ le wo ri. Alla ra hɔrɔ mɛn kili, wo fanan da kɛ a la Mɔɔ Ɲenematɔmɔnin na jɔn di. <verse eid="1CO 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 7:23" />Alla ka ai san sɔnkɔ gbɛlɛn de la. Ai kana kɛ adamadenilu la jɔnilu ri. <verse eid="1CO 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 7:24" />N badenmailu, ai kelen kelenna bɛɛ ye to ai ɲa ma Alla ɲakɔrɔ ikomin ai tɛrɛ ɲa mɛn ma sani Alla ye ai kili.<verse eid="1CO 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mɔɔ mɛnilu furunin tɛ a ni cɛsamusoilu la ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 7:25" />Mɔɔ mɛnilu furunin tɛ, ai ka mɛn sɛbɛ woilu la ko rɔ, an ye na wo ma. Maari la jamarili tɛ ɲin di, kɔni n ye n na miriya le fɔla baa Alla ra n kɛ mɔɔ telennin di a la kininkinin dɔ.<verse eid="1CO 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 7:26" />Tɔrɔya waati ɲin dɔ, a bɛnnin de mɔɔ ye to ikomin a ye ɲa mɛn ma. <verse eid="1CO 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 7:27" />Ni muso ye i bolo, i kana i ban a rɔ ka a bila. Ni muso tɛ i bolo, i kana muso ɲinin. <verse eid="1CO 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 7:28" />Kɔni ni i ka furu kɛ, hakɛ tɛ wo ri. Ni sunkurun siira cɛɛ bon nasii rɔ, julumun tɛ wo ri. Kɔni mɛnilu ka furu kɛ, woilu ri tɔrɔya siyaman sɔrɔn ii la dunuɲaratɛɛ rɔ, n ye a fɛ ka woilu mataa ai la.<verse eid="1CO 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 7:29" />N badenmailu, n ye mɛn ma, wo le ɲin di. Waati ma jan butun. Ka damira sisɛn ma, muso tiilu ye kɛ ikomin muso tɛ ii bolo. <verse eid="1CO 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 7:30" />Mɔɔ mɛnilu ye kasila, ii ye kɛ ikomin ii tɛrɛ tɛ kasila. Mɔɔ mɛnilu sɛwanin, ii ye kɛ ikomin ii tɛrɛ tɛ sɛwanin. Mɛnilu ra sannin kɛ, woilu ye kɛ ikomin ii tɛ fen namarala. <verse eid="1CO 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 7:31" />Mɔɔ mɛnilu ye dunuɲa ɲin tɔnɔbɔla, ii ye kɛ ikomin ii tɛ tɔnɔ sɔrɔnna a rɔ. Baa dunuɲa ɲin ye taminna le.<verse eid="1CO 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 7:32" />Nba, a lɔɔ ye n na le ai ye hɔrɔya haminya bɛɛ ma. Cɛɛ gbana ye a jantola Maari la baara le dɔrɔn ko kosa a ye Maari hɛnɛn. <verse eid="1CO 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 7:33" />Kɔni muso tii ye a jantola dunuɲa koilu le ko kosa a ye a muso hɛnɛn. <verse eid="1CO 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 7:34" />Wo rɔ, a la koilu ratalannin de a ri. Muso mɛn fanan furunin tɛ wala sunkurun, woilu ye ii jantola Maari la baarailu le dɔrɔn ko, kosa ii ye kɛ mɔɔ sɛniman di faribanku ni nii rɔ. Kɔni muso cɛɛ tii, wo ye a jantola dunuɲa koilu le rɔ, kosa a ye a la cɛɛ hɛnɛn.<verse eid="1CO 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 7:35" />N ye wo fɔla ai yɛ ai dɛmɛn ko le rɔ. N karannin tɛ, ka ai lakaɲa, kɔni n ye a fɛ le ai ye to koɲumailu le kan mɛnilu bɛnnin, kosa ai bilanin ye to Maari kɔfɛ mafabaliya rɔ.<verse eid="1CO 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 7:36" />Ni kanberen da sunkurun mamira, ka a miri ko a ye sunkurun tɔrɔla le, ni a ra a makɔrɔya, a ma a furu, ni a ye a fɛ ka a furu, wo rɔ a ye a diyanan ko kɛ, a ma hakɛ kɛ wo rɔ. <verse eid="1CO 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 7:37" />Kɔni ni cɛɛ ka a latɛɛ a jusu rɔ, diyagboya tɛ mɛn di, ko a kana sunkurun furu, a ri se a jɛrɛ mirala fanan, koɲuma le wo fanan di. <verse eid="1CO 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 7:38" />Wo rɔ, mɛn da a ta furu, wo ra koɲuma kɛ, kɔni mɛn ma a ta furu, wo ra koɲuma kɛ ka tamin do la.<verse eid="1CO 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 7:39" />Muso ye sii a cɛɛ kunma haan a la cɛɛ ye faa. Kɔni ni a la cɛɛ faara, a ra hɔrɔya wo rɔ, a ri se siila gbɛrɛ kunma mɛn duman a yɛ. Kɔni a ye kɛ Maari ta le ri. <verse eid="1CO 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 7:40" />Kɔni n na miriya rɔ, sɛwa ye a yɛ fewu, ni a tora a ɲa ma. N lanin a la fanan, ko Alla la Nii ye n fanan dɔ.<verse eid="1CO 7:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CO 8" />
  <para style="s">Sobo mɛn bɔnin sarakaya la jooilu yɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 8:1" />Mɛn bɛnnin soboilu la ko ma mɛn bɔnin sarakaya la jooilu yɛ. An ka a lɔn ko «Lɔnnin ye an bɛɛ bolo.» Lɔnnin ye mɔɔ kɛla wasola le ri, kɔni kaninteya ye lemɛniya le lasabatila. <verse eid="1CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 8:2" />Mɔɔ mɛn ye a mirila ko a ka ko lɔn, wo ma ko lɔn fɔlɔ ikomin a ka kan ka a lɔn ɲa mɛn ma. <verse eid="1CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 8:3" />Kɔni, ni mɔɔ mɛn ka Alla kanin, Alla ka wo tii lɔn.<verse eid="1CO 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 8:4" />Wo le rɔ, ka sobo dɔɔn, mɛn da bɔ sarakayala jooilu yɛ, an ye wo le la ko fɔla butun. An ka a lɔn ko joo kɛnin tɛ foyi ri dunuɲa rɔ. Alla kelen pe le. <verse eid="1CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 8:5" />Hali bato fen siyaman ye duukolo ni sankolo kan, mɔɔ mɛnilu ye a fɔla ko «maariilu,» hali «maari» siyaman ni «faama» siyaman tɛrɛ ye, <verse eid="1CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 8:6" />kɔni andeilu fan fɛ, Alla kelen pe le. Ale le an fa ri mɛn ka fen bɛɛ dan. An ye an na dunuɲaratɛɛ kɛla ale le yɛ. Faama kelen pe le, Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin. Fen bɛɛ dannin ale le baraka rɔ. An ye an na dunuɲaratɛɛ kɛla ale le baraka rɔ.<verse eid="1CO 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 8:7" />Kɔni mɔɔ bɛɛ ma ɲin lɔn. Mɔɔ doilu ra dorin joo sɔ koilu la. Hali sisɛn, ii wa kɛ dɔɔnnifen su ɲin dɔɔnna, ii hankili ri to a ko ko ii ye joo sɔ fen de dɔɔnna. Ii la hankili dɔɔya fanan ye ii kɔsɔla. <verse eid="1CO 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 8:8" />Kɔni dɔɔnnifen tɛ an madonna Alla la. Ni an ma a dɔɔn, an tɛ bɔnɔla foyi rɔ. Ni an ka a dɔɔn, an tɛ tɔnɔ si sɔrɔnna.<verse eid="1CO 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 8:9" />Kɔni hali koilu kɛ ko hɔrɔya yɛ ai la, ai ye a kɛ ai hankili la, ai kana wo mɔɔilu bila julumun dɔ mɛnilu ma fanka sɔrɔn fɔlɔ lemɛniya rɔ. <verse eid="1CO 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 8:10" />Baa mɔɔ mɛn fanka ma bon lemɛniya rɔ ko ɲin dɔ mɛn hankili dɔɔyanin, ni wo ka ile lɔnninna tɛrɛn i ye dɔɔnninna joo bon kɔndɔ, wo tɛ wo fanan nawakali wa a fanan ye jooilu sɔ sobo dɔɔn? <verse eid="1CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 8:11" />Nba, wo mɔɔ mɛn ma se sɔrɔn lemɛniya rɔ, Ɲenematɔmɔnin faanin mɛn yɛ, wo ri halaki ile lɔnninna fɛ wo rɔ. <verse eid="1CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 8:12" />Nba, ai wa hakɛ kɛ i badenma la wo ɲa ma, ka a hankili dɔɔyanin madimin, i ye julumun kɛla fanan Ɲenematɔmɔnin na wo hakɛ le fɛ. <verse eid="1CO 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 8:13" />Wo le rɔ, ni dɔɔnnifen di a kɛ badenma ye bila julumun dɔ, nde fanan tɛ wo sobo dɔɔnna butun, kosa n ti nala a bilala julumun dɔ!<verse eid="1CO 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CO 9" />
  <para style="s">Ko mɛnilu bɛnnin talibidenba ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 9:1" />Hɔrɔ tɛ nde ri wa? Talibidenba tɛ nde ri wa? Nde ma an Maari Isa yen wa? N baara nɔ tɛ ai ri Maari rɔ wa? <verse eid="1CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 9:2" />Hali doilu ma n lɔn talibidenba ri, kɔni fɔɔ aile ye a lɔn de! Baa aile ra lemɛniya, wo kɛnin n na talibidenbaya tɔɔmaserefen de ri Maari rɔ.<verse eid="1CO 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 9:3" />N ye n kunmaka kuma ɲinilu le fɔla n tɔɲɔ mɔɔilu yɛ. <verse eid="1CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 9:4" />An na hakan de tɛ ka dɔɔnnin kɛ ka an min an na baara ko rɔ wa? <verse eid="1CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 9:5" />An na hakan tɛ fanan ka lemɛniya muso do furu wa, ka wa an kɔfɛ taama rɔ ikomin talibidenba doilu ni Maari dɔɔniilu ni Sefasi ye a kɛla ɲa mɛn ma? <verse eid="1CO 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 9:6" />Nde ni Barinabasi le dɔrɔn dahanin wa, ka baara dɔɔnnifen ko rɔ? <verse eid="1CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 9:7" />Tɛsidi ɲuman di a jɛrɛ donin ta a la tɛsidi baara rɔ? Yon di rɛsɛnfɛ lan, a tɛ a jiriden dɔɔn? Yon di kolofenilu gbɛngbɛn a tɛ ii nɔnɔ min?<verse eid="1CO 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 9:8" />N na kuma ɲin kɛnin adamadenilu miriya gbansan de ri wa? Sariya Kitabu fanan ma wo ko kelen de fɔ wa? <verse eid="1CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 9:9" />Baa a sɛbɛnin Musa la Sariya Kitabu kɔndɔ ko, «I wa nisi lɔ suman gbasi la, i kana a da sidi.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">9.9</char> Sariyailu suran 25 kuma diya 4</note> Alla ka a janto nisiilu le gbansan ko wa? <verse eid="1CO 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 9:10" />A ma ɲin de fɔ andeilu la ko rɔ wa? Ɔɔn, ɲin sɛbɛnin andeilu le la ko rɔ fewu. Sɛnɛ kɛla wa kɛ sɛnɛ kɛla, suman kala wa kɛ suman kala, ii jii lanin fen kaninilu ratalan ko le rɔ. <verse eid="1CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 9:11" />Andeilu ra si foyi ai tɛma mɛn kɛnin Alla la koilu ri, ni an ka faribanku dɛmɛn fen sɔrɔn ai bolo, wo ka siya wa? <verse eid="1CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 9:12" />Ni a bɛnnin ai ye doilu dɛmɛn fen ɲinilu la, a bɛnnin tɛ andeilu ye tamin woilu la wa? Adon, andeilu ma sariya ɲin nabaara. A ka jan wo la. An da diɲɛ ko bɛɛ ma kosa foyi kana Ɲenematɔmɔnin na ko Kibaro Ɲuma lasumaya.<verse eid="1CO 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 9:13" />Ai ma a lɔn wa, ko mɔɔ mɛn ye baarala Alla batobonba kɔndɔ, wo ye a balo sɔrɔnna Alla batobonba le kɔndɔ? Mɛnilu ye sarakailu bɔla, woilu ye ii ta sɔrɔnna saraka le rɔ. <verse eid="1CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 9:14" />Maari ka a jamari wo ɲa le ma ko mɛn ye Isa la ko Kibaro Ɲuma lasela, wo ye a balo sɔrɔnna wo le rɔ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">9.14</char> A ragbɛ Matiyu suran 10 kuma diya 10 ni Luka suran 10 kuma diya 7 kɔndɔ.</note><verse eid="1CO 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 9:15" />Kɔni nde tɛ sariya ɲin foyi labaarala. N ma ɲin sɛbɛ ai ma fanan ai matara ko ma ten. A ri diya n yɛ n ye faa sani n jɛrɛdabaya kun ɲin ye bɔ n bolo. <verse eid="1CO 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 9:16" />Adon, n wa Isa la ko Kibaro Ɲuma lase, wo tɛ kɛ jɛrɛdabaya kun di n yɛ baa Alla ra wo donin sii n kun ma. Gbalo ye nde yɛ, ni n ma Kibaro Ɲuma lase! <verse eid="1CO 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 9:17" />Ni n tɛrɛ baara ɲin kɛla n ɲɛnike ɲuma la, n tɛrɛ ri sara sɔrɔn, kɔni baa n diyagboyanin de, n ye donin de dɔrɔn bɔla n kun ma. <verse eid="1CO 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 9:18" />N sara ye nfen di wo rɔ? Wo le ɲin di: n ye Isa la ko Kibaro Ɲuma lase hali n sara ma di kosa n kana wo sariya labaara ka fen sɔrɔn Kibaro Ɲuma fɛ.<verse eid="1CO 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 9:19" />Hɔrɔ le nde ri, mɔɔ si la jɔn tɛ nde ri kɔni n da n jɛrɛ kɛ mɔɔ bɛɛ la jɔn di kosa n ye mɔɔ siyaman sɔrɔn n di se mɛn na. <verse eid="1CO 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 9:20" />N tɛrɛ Judiyailu tɛma, n ka n jɛrɛ kɛ ikomin Judiyailu kosa n ye ii masɔrɔn. Mɛnilu ye sariya kɔrɔ, n wa kɛ woilu tɛma, n di n jɛrɛ kɛ ikomin n ye sariya le kɔrɔ kosa n ye woilu masɔrɔn, hali n tɛrɛ tɛ sariya kɔrɔ. <verse eid="1CO 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 9:21" />Mɛnilu ma sariya sɔrɔn, n ka n jɛrɛ kɛ woilu tɛma ikomin iile, mɛnilu ma sariya lɔn kosa n ye woilu fanan masɔrɔn hali n ma hɔrɔya Alla la sariya ma kɔni n ye Ɲenematɔmɔnin na sariya le kɔrɔ. <verse eid="1CO 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 9:22" />Mɔɔ mɛnilu ma fanka sɔrɔn lemɛniya rɔ, n ka to woilu tɛma ikomin mɛn fanka dɔɔman, kosa n ye ii masɔrɔn. N da n jɛrɛ kɛ mɔɔ su bɛɛ ri bɛɛ ma kosa n ye doilu lakisi ɲa bɛɛ ma.<verse eid="1CO 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 9:23" />N ye ɲin bɛɛ kɛla Alla la kuma Kibaro Ɲuma le la ko la kosa n fanan ye n ta sɔrɔn a rɔ.<verse eid="1CO 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 9:24" />Ai ma a lɔn wa ko mɛnilu ye ii ladɛnna ii bori kanma keleya bori rɔ, ko ii bɛɛ ri ii bori kɔni kelen de a kɔndɔn sɔrɔnna? Wo rɔ, ai ye ai bori a bori ɲa ma kosa ai ye a kɔndɔn sɔrɔn. <verse eid="1CO 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 9:25" />Mɔɔ mɛn karannin a ɲɔɔn to ko rɔ ko su ɲinilu rɔ fɔɔ wo tii ye a raja, ka a rabɛn jɛrɛ mira rɔ ko bɛɛ ma. A ye wo kɛla le kosa fanka sɔrɔn tɔɔmasere ye don a kun na, mɛn ti nala mɛnna. Kɔni andeilu ye a kɛla le kosa mansaya tɔɔmasere ye don an kun na mɛn ye tola habadan. <verse eid="1CO 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 9:26" />Wo le rɔ, n tɛ n borila n kun fɛ. N tɛ kɛlɛ kɛla ikomin mɔɔ mɛn ye a bolo lafilila fɔɲɔ rɔ dɔrɔn. <verse eid="1CO 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 9:27" />A ka jan wo la. N ye n fari mirala a gbɛlɛnman de la ikomin jɔn, kosa n wa kawandili kɛ doilu yɛ, nde jɛrɛ ti nala bɔnɔla n kɔndɔn dɔ.<verse eid="1CO 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CO 10" />
  <para style="s">Joo ko lalili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 10:1" />N badenmailu, n ye a fɛ ai ye a lɔn ko an benbailu bilara le Musa kɔfɛ duru kɔrɔ, ii bɛɛ ka kɔɔji ratɛɛ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">10.1</char> A ragbɛ Hɔrɔya suran 13 kuma diya 21 haan 22 ni suran 14 kuma diya 22 haan 29 kɔndɔ.</note> <verse eid="1CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 10:2" />A kɛnin de ikomin ii sunda le ji rɔ Musa bolo duru ni kɔɔji rɔ. <verse eid="1CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 10:3" />Ii bɛɛ ka wo niimaya dɔɔnnifen kelen dɔɔn, <verse eid="1CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 10:4" />ii ka wo niimaya ji kelen min, baa ii ka ji min de ka bɔ Alla la kaba rɔ kaba mɛn kɛnin a la Mɔɔ Ɲenematɔmɔnin di mɛn bilanin tɛrɛ ii kɔfɛ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">10.4</char> A ragbɛ Hɔrɔya suran 16 kuma diya 4 haan 35 ni Sariyailu suran 8 kuma diya 3 ni Jateilu suran 20 kuma diya 8 haan 11 kɔndɔ.</note> <verse eid="1CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 10:5" />Kɔni hali wo, ii siyaman ma Alla hɛnɛn, ii suilu tora kiɲɛ fufu kɔndɔ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">10.5</char> A ragbɛ Jateilu suran 14 kuma diya 16 ni suran 14 kuma diya 23 ni suran 14 kuma diya 29 haan 30 kɔndɔ.</note><verse eid="1CO 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 10:6" />Nba, misali le woilu bɛɛ ri andeilu yɛ kosa an kana nata juu ta ikomin woilu ka a kɛ ɲa mɛn ma. <verse eid="1CO 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 10:7" />An kana joo bato ikomin wo doilu ka a kɛ ɲa mɛn ma. Baa a sɛbɛnin Kitabu kɔndɔ ko, «Jama ka ii sii dɔɔnnin diya ka ii min, ka ii lawuli ii lamaa kanma.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">10.7</char> Hɔrɔya suran 32 kuma diya 6</note> <verse eid="1CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 10:8" />An kana jalonya kɛ ikomin wo doilu ka a kɛ ɲa mɛn ma, ii mɔɔ waa muwan ni sawa (23,000) faara tele kelen dɔ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">10.8</char> A ragbɛ Jateilu suran 25 kuma diya 1 haan 9 kɔndɔ.</note> <verse eid="1CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 10:9" />An kana Ɲenematɔmɔnin kɔrɔbɔ ikomin doilu ka a kɛ ɲa mɛn ma, sailu ka ii faa. <verse eid="1CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 10:10" />An kana an dalakasi ikomin doilu ka a kɛ ɲa mɛn ma, Alla ka Halaki kɛla lana, ka ii faa. <verse eid="1CO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 10:11" />Ko ɲinilu bɛɛ kɛra le ii la, ii kɛra misaliilu ri, ka ii sɛbɛ an nalɔnnin fen di, waati laban da se mɛnilu ma. <verse eid="1CO 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 10:12" />Wo rɔ, mɛn wa a miri ko a lɔnnin kosɛbɛ, wo ye a kɛ a hankili la kosa a kana be.<verse eid="1CO 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 10:13" />Ai lafili ko mɛnilu ra ai sɔrɔn, woilu dorinnin adamadenilu sɔrɔnna le. Alla telennin: a ti nala sɔnna fili ko ye ai sɔrɔn ka tamin ai fanka jate la. Wo rɔ, fili ko wa kɛ ai kɔfɛ, kɔni Alla ri wo rabɔ fɛrɛ di ai ma, kosa ai ye se a kɔrɔ.<verse eid="1CO 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 10:14" />Wo le rɔ, n kanintenilu, ai ye ai bori joo bato kɔrɔ. <verse eid="1CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 10:15" />N ye kumala ai yɛ ikomin hankilimailu, ai jɛrɛ ye n na kuma ragbɛ. <verse eid="1CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 10:16" />An wa baraka bila Alla yɛ Maari la jilafɛ la ko rɔ, wo ti an nadɛnna Ɲenematɔmɔnin jeli le fɛ wa? An ye buru mɛn dakadikadila wo waati rɔ, wo ti an nadɛnna Ɲenematɔmɔnin faribanku le fɛ wa?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">10.16</char> Maari la dɔɔnnin de ɲin di. A ragbɛ Luka suran 22 kuma diya 19 ni Korɛnti Fɔlɔ suran 11 kuma diya 23 haan 26 kɔndɔ.</note> <verse eid="1CO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 10:17" />Baa burukala kelen de a ri, an da kɛ ikomin faribanku kelen pe, hali an ka siya, baa an bɛɛ ye do sɔrɔnna wo burukala kelen de rɔ.<verse eid="1CO 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 10:18" />Ai ye Isirayɛlikailu ragbɛ, mɛnilu ye saraka soboilu dɔɔnna, bɛn tɛ woilu ni saraka bɔ diya tɛma wa? <verse eid="1CO 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 10:19" />N ye a fɛ ka nfen fɔ wo rɔ? Joo sɔ kɛnin fanka do le ri wa wala sobo mɛn bɔnin joo yɛ wo kɛnin fen bɛrɛ le ri wa? <verse eid="1CO 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 10:20" />Wo tɛ wo ri, kɔni joo batolailu ye saraka mɛnilu bɔla, ii ye woilu lasela jenailu le ma, Alla tɛ. Nba, n tɛ a fɛ bɛn ye to ai ni jenailu tɛma. <verse eid="1CO 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 10:21" />Ai ti se ai minna Maari la jilafɛ la, ka ai min jooilu la jilafɛ la fanan. Ai ti se Maari la dɔɔnnin fenilu dɔɔnna a ni jenailu la dɔɔnnin fenilu. <verse eid="1CO 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 10:22" />An ye a fɛ ka Maari la keleya lawuli wa? An fanka ka bon a ri wa?<verse eid="1CO 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 10:23" />«Ko bɛɛ dahanin andeilu yɛ.» Kɔni tɔnɔ tɛ ko bɛɛ la. «Ko bɛɛ dahanin andeilu yɛ,» kɔni ko bɛɛ tɛ an dɛmɛnna. <verse eid="1CO 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 10:24" />Mɔɔ si kana hɛrɛ ɲinin a jɛrɛ yɛ, fɔɔ a ye a ɲinin mɔɔ gbɛrɛilu yɛ. <verse eid="1CO 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 10:25" />Fen mɛn bɛɛ ye sanna lɔfɛ rɔ, ai ye wo dɔɔn. Ai kana ɲininkali kɛ ni ai tana tɛ a ri. <verse eid="1CO 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 10:26" />Baa, «Maari le ta ye duu ni a rakɛ fenilu bɛɛ ri.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">10.26</char> A ragbɛ Yaburi suran 24 kuma diya 1 kɔndɔ.</note> <verse eid="1CO 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 10:27" />Ni lemɛniyabali do ka ai kili dɔɔnnin diya, ni wa lɔɔ ye ai la, a wa dɔɔnnifen mɛn don ai bolo, ai ye wo dɔɔn. Ai kana ɲininkali kɛ ni ai tana tɛ a ri. <verse eid="1CO 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 10:28" />Kɔni ni mɔɔ do ka a fɔ ai yɛ ko, «Dɔɔnnifen ɲin da lase joo ma,» wo rɔ, ai kana wo dɔɔnnifen dɔɔn ka a masɔrɔn wo mɔɔ la ko rɔ mɛn ka ai lalɔnnin ka bɛn hankili jate ma. <verse eid="1CO 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 10:29" />Aile hankili jate tɛ kɔni fɔɔ do hankili. Adon, nfenna nde la hɔrɔya ri kɛ jalaki ri mɔɔ gbɛrɛ hankili rɔ? <verse eid="1CO 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 10:30" />Ni n ka baraka bila Alla yɛ n na dɔɔnnifen na ko rɔ, nfenna mɔɔ do ri n nafɛya ka bɛn wo dɔɔnnifen na ko ma, n da baraka bila Alla yɛ mɛn na ko rɔ?<verse eid="1CO 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 10:31" />Wo rɔ, ni ai ye dɔɔnnifen dɔɔnna wala ka ai min, ai wa kɛ foyi kɛla, ai ye a kɛ Alla la gbiliya la ko rɔ. <verse eid="1CO 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 10:32" />Ai kɛwaliilu kana Judiyailu lafili, wala Kirɛkiilu wala Alla la lemɛniya jama, <verse eid="1CO 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 10:33" />ikomin nde fanan karannin ka mɔɔ bɛɛ hɛnɛn n na ko kɛ ɲailu bɛɛ rɔ ɲa mɛn ma. N tɛ koɲuma ɲininna n jɛrɛ dɔrɔn yɛ, fɔɔ mɔɔ siyaman yɛ kosa woilu fanan ye kisi.<verse eid="1CO 10:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CO 11" />
  <para style="s">Ko mɛnilu dahanin sali waati rɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 11:1" />Ai ye kɛ n nadɛn mɔɔilu ri, ikomin nde fanan ye Ɲenematɔmɔnin nadɛnna ɲa mɛn ma.<verse eid="1CO 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 11:2" />N da ai tando, n na ko ra labila ai la ko bɛɛ rɔ, ka karan koilu mira ikomin n ka a fɔ ai yɛ ɲa mɛn ma.<verse eid="1CO 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 11:3" />Kɔni, n ye a fɛ ai ye a lɔn ko Ɲenematɔmɔnin de cɛɛilu bɛɛ kun na. Cɛɛ le muso kun na. Alla le a la Mɔɔ Ɲenematɔmɔnin kun na. <verse eid="1CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 11:4" />Cɛɛ bɛɛ mɛn ye Alla matarala, wala mɛn ye nabiya kumailu fɔla, ni a ka a kun nabirin, a ra a kun ɲɛbu. <verse eid="1CO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 11:5" />Kɔni, muso mɛn ye Alla matarala, wala ka nabiya kumailu fɔ, a kun nakolon yɛ, wo ye a kun de ɲɛbula. Wo kɛnin de ikomin a wa a kun li. <verse eid="1CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 11:6" />Ni muso ma a kun masidi, a bɛnnin de ka a kun li fanan. Kɔni muso kun linin, wala a matɛɛnin, baa wo bɛɛ mamaloyanin de, a bɛnnin de wo rɔ ka a kun masidi. <verse eid="1CO 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 11:7" />Cɛɛ ma kan ka a kun nabirin baa a kɛnin Alla munuɲa ni a la gbiliya le ri. Kɔni muso le cɛɛ la gbiliya ri. <verse eid="1CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 11:8" />Baa Alla ma cɛɛ bɔ muso rɔ, kɔni muso le bɔnin cɛɛ rɔ. <verse eid="1CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 11:9" />Cɛɛ dannin tɛ muso la ko rɔ, kɔni muso le dannin cɛɛ la ko rɔ. <verse eid="1CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 11:10" />Wo le rɔ, muso ye a kun masidi fanka tɔɔmasere ri, mɛlɛkailu la ko rɔ. <verse eid="1CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 11:11" />Kɔni Maari rɔ, muso faranin tɛ cɛɛ la, cɛɛ fanan faranin tɛ muso la. <verse eid="1CO 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 11:12" />Baa ikomin muso bɔnin cɛɛ rɔ, wo rɔ cɛɛ fanan bɔnin muso fan fɛ. Kɔni ko bɛɛ bɔnin Alla le rɔ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">11.12</char> A ragbɛ A Damira suran 1 kuma diya 26 haan 27 ni suran 2 kuma diya 18 haan 23 kɔndɔ.</note><verse eid="1CO 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 11:13" />Aile jɛrɛ ye wo ko makiti: Ni muso ka kan ka Alla matara a kun masidinin tɛ wa? <verse eid="1CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 11:14" />Nba, adamaden kɛɲa tɛ ai karanna wa, ni cɛɛ kunsi yanyanda, a ri maloya wo rɔ, <verse eid="1CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 11:15" />kɔni gbiliya le wo ri muso yɛ ni a kunsi yanyanda bakɛ. Baa a kunsi la yanyan da kɛ a masidi fen di? <verse eid="1CO 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 11:16" />Kɔni ni mɔɔ do ye a fɛ ka sɔsɔli kɛ, an dorinna ko tɛ woilu ri, wala lemɛniya jama fanan.<verse eid="1CO 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maari la dɔɔnnin na ko<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wo ko sɛbɛnin fanan Matiyu suran 26 kuma diya 26 haan 29 Marika suran 14 kuma diya 22 haan 25 a ni Luka suran 22 kuma diya 14 haan 20 kɔndɔ</char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 11:17" />N ye kuma mɛn fɔla ai yɛ ten, n tɛ ai tandola wo la ka a masɔrɔn ai la ladɛn ye kojuu kɛ le ri ka tamin ɲuma la. <verse eid="1CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 11:18" />Ko fɔlɔ, ii tɛrɛ ra a fɔ n yɛ ko ai wa ai ladɛn lemɛniya jama ɲa ma, latalali koilu ye ai tɛma. N lanin wo la haan yɔrɔ do. <verse eid="1CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 11:19" />A fɛrɛ tɛ ye fɔɔ latalanni do ye to ai tɛma, kosa mɛnilu ka Alla hɛnɛ, woilu ye lɔn. <verse eid="1CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 11:20" />Ai wa ai ladɛn waati mɛn na, ai tɛ Maari la dɔɔnnifen de dɔɔnna, <verse eid="1CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 11:21" />baa ai wa kɛ dɔɔnnin kɛla, bɛɛ ye a kaliyala le a fanba dɔɔn diya. Wo le rɔ, kɔnkɔ ye doilu la, doilu ɲa laminin de. <verse eid="1CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 11:22" />Bon tɛ ai bolo wa, ai ri dɔɔnnifen dɔɔn yɔrɔ mɛn dɔ, ka ai min? Ai ri Alla la lemɛniya jama lagboyaɲɛ wa, ka bolokolonilu lamaloya? N di nfen fɔ ai yɛ? N di ai tando wo rɔ wa? Wo rɔ, n tɛ ai tando muumɛ!<verse eid="1CO 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 11:23" />Baa Maari ka n karan mɛn na, n fanan da ai karan wo la ko Maari Isa janfara ka don bolo rɔ, su mɛn dɔ, a ka buru ta le, <verse eid="1CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 11:24" />ka baraka bila Alla yɛ, ka a kurunkurun bɔ ka a fɔ ko, «N faribanku le ɲin di mɛn dinin ai la ko rɔ. Ai ye ɲin kɛ mɛn di n na ko labila ai la.» <verse eid="1CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 11:25" />Ii bannin a dɔɔnna, a ka jilafɛ fanan ta ka a fɔ ko, «Teriya kura mɛn sidinin an tɛma n jeli fɛ, wo le ɲin di. Ai wa kɛ ɲin minna waati si rɔ, n na ko ye labila ai la.» <verse eid="1CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 11:26" />Baa ai wa kɛ buru ɲin dɔɔnna waati mɛn na, ka ai min minninfen ɲin na, ai ye Maari la saya ko le lasela haan a ye na.<verse eid="1CO 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 11:27" />Wo le rɔ, ni mɔɔ si ka Maari la buru dɔɔn, wala ka a min Maari la jilafɛ la kɛɲa dahabaliya rɔ, wo tii ye julumun de tala Maari faribanku ni a jeli la. <verse eid="1CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 11:28" />Wo le rɔ, bɛɛ ye a jɛrɛ kɔrɔsi, ka Maari la buru dɔɔn, ka a min Maari la jilafɛ fanan na wo ɲa ma. <verse eid="1CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 11:29" />Baa mɛn wa buru ɲin dɔɔn, ka a min jilafɛ ɲin na, ka a tɛrɛn a tɛ Maari faribanku la ko lɔnna, a ye kiti le kilila a jɛrɛ ma. <verse eid="1CO 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 11:30" />Wo le rɔ, ai siyaman ye jankarɔla, fanka tɛ ai la, doilu ra faa. <verse eid="1CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 11:31" />Kɔni ni an ka an jɛrɛ kɔrɔbɔ, an di tanka Alla la kiti ma. <verse eid="1CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 11:32" />Kɔni Maari wa an kiti, a ye an makolola le kosa an ni dunuɲa mɔɔilu ti nala jalakila an ɲɔɔn fɛ.<verse eid="1CO 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 11:33" />Wo le rɔ, n badenmailu, ai wa ai ladɛn waati mɛn na dɔɔnnin diya, ai ye ai ɲɔɔn makɔnɔn. <verse eid="1CO 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 11:34" />Ni kɔnkɔ ye do la, a ye dɔɔnnin kɛ a wara kosa ai la ladɛn kana kiti kili ai ma. N wa na waati mɛn na, n di ko gbɛrɛilu ɲafɔ.<verse eid="1CO 11:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CO 12" />
  <para style="s">Alla la Nii Sɛniman na Dinmalifenilu la ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 12:1" />Ai ka mɛn sɛbɛ Alla la dinmali sɔnɔmɛ rɔ, n badenmailu, n tɛ a fɛ ai ye to ko lɔnbaliya rɔ. <verse eid="1CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 12:2" />Ai ye a lɔn ko ai tɛrɛ lemɛniyabaliya rɔ waati mɛn na, ai bilanin tɛrɛ jooilu le kɔfɛ mɛnilu tɛ kumala. <verse eid="1CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 12:3" />Wo le rɔ, n ye a fɔla ai yɛ ko, mɔɔ si ye kumala Alla la Nii Sɛniman baraka rɔ, wo ti se a fɔla ko, «Isa ye danka.» Mɔɔ ti se a fɔla fanan ko, «Maari le Isa ri,» Alla la Nii Sɛniman kɔma.<verse eid="1CO 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 12:4" />Alla la Nii Sɛniman kelen pe le a ri, kɔni a la sɔlifen su ka siya. <verse eid="1CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 12:5" />Maari kelen pe le a ri, kɔni mɔɔilu ye baarala a yɛ ɲa siyaman. <verse eid="1CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 12:6" />Baara su ka siya, kɔni Alla kelen de woilu bɛɛ dafala mɔɔilu bɛɛ rɔ. <verse eid="1CO 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 12:7" />Alla ka a kɛ ka a la Nii Sɛniman nabɔ gbɛma mɔɔ kelen kelenna bɛɛ fɛ kosa jama bɛɛ ye a tɔnɔ sɔrɔn. <verse eid="1CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 12:8" />Mɔɔ do ye waliji kelaya sɔrɔnna Alla la Nii Sɛniman baraka le rɔ. Mɔɔ gbɛrɛ ye lɔnnin kelaya sɔrɔnna Alla la Nii Sɛniman baraka le rɔ. <verse eid="1CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 12:9" />Mɔɔ gbɛrɛ ye lemɛniya sɔrɔnna Alla la Nii Sɛniman baraka le rɔ. Mɔɔ gbɛrɛ ye dandannin sebaya sɔrɔnna wo Nii Sɛniman kelen baraka le rɔ. <verse eid="1CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 12:10" />Mɔɔ gbɛrɛ ye kabannako kɛ sebaya sɔrɔnna, mɔɔ gbɛrɛ ye nabiya kumailu sɔrɔnna, gbɛrɛ ye fanka juuilu ni Alla fanka dannafara bɔla, gbɛrɛ ye kan su gbɛrɛilu sɔrɔnna, gbɛrɛ fanan ye kan gbɛrɛilu lataminna. <verse eid="1CO 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 12:11" />Kɔni ale Alla la Nii Sɛniman kelen de wo bɛɛ kɛla. Ale le mɔɔ kelen kelenna bɛɛ sɔla ikomin a ye a fɛ ɲa mɛn ma.<verse eid="1CO 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Faribanku kelen de a ri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 12:12" />Nba, Ɲenematɔmɔnin kɛnin de ikomin faribanku kelen kɔni fan siyaman ye a ma. Kɔni hali a fanilu ka siya, faribanku kelen de a ri. <verse eid="1CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 12:13" />Baa an bɛɛ sunnin ji rɔ Alla la Nii Sɛniman kelen de baraka rɔ, ka an don faribanku kelen dɔ, Judiyailu ni Kirɛkiilu, jɔnilu ni hɔrɔilu, Alla ra Nii Sɛniman kelen di an bɛɛ ma.<verse eid="1CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 12:14" />Faribanku ladannin tɛ sɔrɔmaɲa kelen di kɔni sɔrɔmaɲa siyaman ye a ma. <verse eid="1CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 12:15" />Ni sen ka a fɔ ko, «Nde tɛ faribanku rɔ, baa n kɛnin tɛ bolo ri,» wo tɛ a bɔ fari ma. <verse eid="1CO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 12:16" />Ni tolo ka a fɔ ko, «Nde tɛ faribanku rɔ, baa n kɛnin tɛ ɲa ri,» wo tɛ a bɔ fari ma. <verse eid="1CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 12:17" />Ni faribanku bɛɛ kɛra ɲa le dɔrɔn di, ko tɛrɛ mɛnna di wo rɔ? Ni faribanku bɛɛ kɛra tolo le dɔrɔn di, fen suma tɛrɛ mɛnna di wo rɔ? <verse eid="1CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 12:18" />Kɔni Alla ra faribanku sɔrɔmaɲa bɛɛ ɲabɔ ikomin a ye a fɛ ɲa mɛn ma. <verse eid="1CO 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 12:19" />Ni a bɛɛ tɛrɛ kɛra fen kelen pe ri, faribanku tɛrɛ tola min? <verse eid="1CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 12:20" />A ye ɲa mɛn ma ten, sɔrɔmaɲa ka siya kɔni faribanku kelen de.<verse eid="1CO 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 12:21" />Wo le rɔ, ɲa ti se a fɔla bolo ma ko, «N mako ti i la.» Kun tɛ a fɔ senilu ma ko, «N mako tɛ ai la.» <verse eid="1CO 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 12:22" />A ka jan wo la. Hali fanka tɛ faribanku fan mɛnilu la, ii lɔdiya ye ye. <verse eid="1CO 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 12:23" />Hali fari fan mɛnilu mamaloyanin ka tamin fari fanilu bɛɛ la, an ye woilu masidila gbiliya rɔ kosɛbɛ. Fari fan mɛnilu ma kan ka yen, an ye yɔrɔ woilu sutura doilu ko. <verse eid="1CO 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 12:24" />Kɔni faribanku fan mɛnilu mamaloyanin tɛ, woilu mako tɛ wo la. Alla jɛrɛ ra an faribanku fanilu ɲabɔ, ka gbiliya di faribanku fanilu ma a dɛsɛnin tɛrɛ mɛnilu ma, <verse eid="1CO 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 12:25" />kosa faribanku kana latalan, kɔni sɔrɔmaɲa fanilu bɛɛ ye ii janto ii ɲɔɔn ko. <verse eid="1CO 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 12:26" />Ni faribanku fan do ye tɔrɔya rɔ, faribanku fan tɔ bɛɛ ri tɔrɔ a fɛ. Ni fan kelen ka gbiliya sɔrɔn, doilu bɛɛ ri sɛwa a fɛ.<verse eid="1CO 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 12:27" />Nba, aile le Ɲenematɔmɔnin faribanku ri. A sɔrɔmaɲa fan do le ai kelen kelenna bɛɛ ri. <verse eid="1CO 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 12:28" />Lemɛniya jama rɔ, Alla ka talibidenba le lasii lɔdiya fɔlɔ rɔ, a filana kelalaselailu, a sawana karanmɔɔilu, a ni kabannako kɛ mɔɔilu, ni mɛnilu sɔnin mɔɔ dandalila dinmalifen dɔ, a ni dɛmɛnnin kɛ dinmalifen, ni ɲɛmɔɔ dinmalifen a ni mɛnilu ye kumala kan gbɛrɛilu rɔ. <verse eid="1CO 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 12:29" />Bɛɛ ti kɛ talibidenba ri, wala kelalaselailu wala karanmɔɔilu wala kabannako kɛ mɔɔilu <verse eid="1CO 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 12:30" />wala mɔɔ mɛn sɔnin dandannin kɛ ma wala kan gbɛrɛ fɔ wala kan natamin. <verse eid="1CO 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 12:31" />Kɔni, ai ye kunfan dinmalifen fisamantɛilu kɔfɛ. Sisɛn n ye sila fisamantɛ le yiraka ai la. Wo le ten:<verse eid="1CO 12:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CO 13" />
  <para style="s">Kaninteya la ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 13:1" />Ni n kumara adamaden kanilu ni mɛlɛka kanilu rɔ, kɔni kaninteya tɛ n jusu rɔ, n kumakan kɛnin de wo rɔ ikomin talan kan ni sangban kan. <verse eid="1CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 13:2" />Ni n ka nabiya kuma dinmali sɔrɔn, ka hankilimaya gbundu koilu bɛɛ rɔ, ka lɔnnin bɛɛ sɔrɔn, a ni lemɛniya ba ye n dɔ, mɛn di koyinkɛilu bɔ ii nɔ rɔ, kɔni ni kaninteya tɛ n jusu rɔ, foyi tɛ nde ri wo rɔ. <verse eid="1CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 13:3" />Ni n wa n bolofen bɛɛ di bolokolonilu ma, ni n wa n faribanku di ko a ri janin, kɔni kaninteya tɛ n jusu rɔ, wo tɛ foyi dila n ma.<verse eid="1CO 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 13:4" />Diɲɛ ye kaninteya rɔ. Kaninteya ye koɲuma le kɛla. Keleya tɛ kaninteya rɔ. Kaninteya tɛ a jɛrɛdabayala. Waso tɛ kaninteya rɔ. <verse eid="1CO 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 13:5" />Maloya tɛ a rɔ. A ma a jɛrɛ la hɛrɛ dɔrɔn karan. A jusu tɛ bɔla foyi rɔ. A ma duɲa lamara. <verse eid="1CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 13:6" />A tɛ sɛwa telenbaliya la fɔɔ tuɲa. <verse eid="1CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 13:7" />A ye makotoli le kɛla ko bɛɛ rɔ. A lemɛniyanin waati bɛɛ. Jii ye a ma ko bɛɛ rɔ. A tunadiyanin ko bɛɛ ma.<verse eid="1CO 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 13:8" />Kaninteya tɛ banna habadan. Kɔni nabiya kumailu ri tamin, kan gbɛrɛilu ri ban, lɔnnin di tamin. <verse eid="1CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 13:9" />Baa dan ye an na ko lɔn na, an ye nabiya kumailu fɔla dɔɔnin, <verse eid="1CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 13:10" />kɔni a dafanin wa na waati mɛn na, a dafabali ri ban wo rɔ.<verse eid="1CO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 13:11" />N tɛrɛ den mɛsɛnya rɔ waati mɛn na, n tɛrɛ kumala ikomin denmɛsɛn, n tɛrɛ n mirila ikomin denmɛsɛn, n tɛrɛ koilu famunna ikomin denmɛsɛn. Kɔni n balikuyanin, n ka denmɛsɛnya ko lasɛ n kɔfɛ. <verse eid="1CO 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 13:12" />Sisɛn, an ye sawura ladibinin de yenna ikomin mafɛnɛnnin dubalen, kɔni waati natɔ rɔ, an di yennin kɛ ɲa ni ɲa. Sisɛn, dan ye n na ko lɔn na, wo waati rɔ n di koilu lɔn ikomin Alla ka n lɔn ɲa mɛn ma.<verse eid="1CO 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 13:13" />Sisɛn ko sawa ɲinilu tola le, lemɛniya ni jii ni kaninteya, kɔni kaninteya le ka bon ii bɛɛ ko.<verse eid="1CO 13:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CO 14" />
  <para style="s">Alla la Nii Sɛniman na Niilifenilu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 14:1" />Ai ye ai raja ka to kaninteya rɔ. Nii Sɛniman na dinmalifenilu kunfan ye ai mira, a gbengben ai ye nabiya kumailu fɔ. <verse eid="1CO 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 14:2" />Baa mɔɔ mɛn ye kan gbɛrɛ fɔla, wo tɛ kumala mɔɔilu le yɛ, fɔɔ Alla, ka a masɔrɔn mɔɔ si tɛ a kan mɛnna. A ye gbundu koilu fɔla Alla la Nii Sɛniman baraka le rɔ. <verse eid="1CO 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 14:3" />Kɔni mɛn ye nabiya kumailu fɔla, wo ye kumala ii sabati ko le la, ka ii lalemɛniya, ka ii jusu suma. <verse eid="1CO 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 14:4" />Mɔɔ mɛn ye kumala kan gbɛrɛ rɔ, wo ye a jɛrɛ le dɔrɔn dɛmɛnna, kɔni mɛn ye nabiya kumailu fɔla, wo ye lemɛniya jama bɛɛ le dɛmɛnna.<verse eid="1CO 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 14:5" />Ni ai bɛɛ ye kan gbɛrɛilu fɔla, wo duman n yɛ. Kɔni mɛn duman n yɛ ka tamin wo la, ai bɛɛ ye nabiya kumailu fɔ. Ka a masɔrɔn mɔɔ mɛn ye nabiya kumailu fɔla, wo taminnin kan gbɛrɛ fɔla, fɔɔ ni mɔɔ do ye ye mɛn di a kan natamin kosa lemɛniya jama bɛɛ ri dɛmɛn ɲa mɛn ma. <verse eid="1CO 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 14:6" />N badenmailu, ni n wara ai tɔrɔfɛ, ka wa kuma ai yɛ kan gbɛrɛilu rɔ, n ka nfen ɲa ai ma wo rɔ, na n ma Alla la ko do yiraka ai la, wala lɔnnin do wala nabiya kuma wala karan?<verse eid="1CO 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 14:7" />Hali fɔlifenilu, nii tɛ woilu mɛn dɔ, wo fanan ye wo ɲa le ma, ikomin fule ni silaman. Ii ye fɔlifenkan mɛn nabɔla, mɔɔ ye wo lɔnna di na ii ma a kan nabɔ a ɲuma la? <verse eid="1CO 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 14:8" />Ni buru kan ɲuma ma bɔ fanan, ka gbɛ, yon di a rabɛn kɛlɛkɛ kanma? <verse eid="1CO 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 14:9" />A ye wo ɲa le ma ai wara, ai wa kuma kan gbɛrɛilu rɔ, na a ma kɛ kumakan gbɛnin di, wo kɔrɔ ye lɔnna di wo rɔ? Kuma fuu le dɔrɔn ye wo ri. <verse eid="1CO 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 14:10" />Kan siyaman de dunuɲa rɔ, kɔni woilu foyi tɛ ye mɛn kɔrɔ tɛ a la. <verse eid="1CO 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 14:11" />Kɔni kan mɛn ye fɔla, ni n ma a kɔrɔ lɔn, mɛn ye a fɔla, londan de nde ri wo ɲakɔrɔ. Londan de a fanan di n ɲakɔrɔ. <verse eid="1CO 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 14:12" />A ye wo ɲa le ma ai fanan yɛ. Baa ai lɔɔ ye Alla la Nii Sɛniman na dinmalifenilu la, mɛnilu ye lemɛniya jama dɛmɛnna, ai ye ai raja woilu le ma.<verse eid="1CO 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 14:13" />Wo le rɔ, mɔɔ mɛn ye kumala kan gbɛrɛ rɔ, a ye Alla matara kosa a ri se a kɔrɔ fɔla. <verse eid="1CO 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 14:14" />Baa ni n ka Alla matara kan gbɛrɛ rɔ, n nii le Alla matarala wo rɔ, kɔni n hankili tɛ baarala. <verse eid="1CO 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 14:15" />N di nfen kɛ wo rɔ? N di Alla matara n nii rɔ a ni n hankili fanan dɔ. N di kalaman bɔ n nii rɔ a ni n hankili fanan dɔ. <verse eid="1CO 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 14:16" />I wa baraka bila Alla yɛ i nii rɔ, mɔɔ mɛn ma wo kɔrɔ lɔn, wo ye a fɔla di ko «Amina» ka a masɔrɔn i ye mɛn fɔla, a ma wo lɔn? <verse eid="1CO 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 14:17" />Hali i ye baraka bilala Alla yɛ kosɛbɛ, mɔɔ gbɛrɛ tɛ dɛmɛnnin sɔrɔnna.<verse eid="1CO 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 14:18" />N ye baraka bilala Alla yɛ ka a masɔrɔn nde ye kan gbɛrɛilu fɔla ka tamin ai bɛɛ la. <verse eid="1CO 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 14:19" />Kɔni an wa kɛ lemɛniya jama ladɛn dɔ hali n ka kumakan loolu le dɔrɔn fɔ, mɛnilu kɔrɔ ri lɔn, kosa n ye mɔɔilu karan, wo ka fisa nde yɛ sani n ye kuma waa siyaman fɔ kan gbɛrɛ rɔ.<verse eid="1CO 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 14:20" />N badenmailu, ai hankili kana kɛ ikomin denniilu. Ai ye kɛ ikomin denmɛsɛnilu kojuuilu la ko rɔ, kɔni ai ye kɛ balikuyanin di ai hankili rɔ. <verse eid="1CO 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 14:21" />A sɛbɛnin Sariya Kitabu kɔndɔ:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">«Maari ka a fɔ ko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">‹N ye kumala jama ɲin yɛ woilu le fɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">mɛnilu ye londan kanilu fɔla</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">a ni londanilu da rɔ kan fɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">kɔni hali wo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">ii ti nala ii tolo malɔla n na.› »<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">14.21</char> Esayi suran 28 kuma diya 11 haan 12</note><verse eid="1CO 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 14:22" />Wo rɔ, kan gbɛrɛilu kɛnin tɔɔmasereilu ri lemɛniyabaliilu le yɛ. A tɛ kɛla lemɛniya mɔɔilu la ko rɔ, kɔni nabiya kumailu kɛnin tɛ tɔɔmasereilu ri lemɛniyabaliilu yɛ fɔɔ lemɛniya mɔɔilu.<verse eid="1CO 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 14:23" />Nba, ni lemɛniya jama bɛɛ ka ii ladɛn, bɛɛ ye kumala a ta kan gbɛrɛilu rɔ, ni mɔɔ doilu nara, mɛnilu ma a kɔrɔ lɔn wala ii lemɛniyanin tɛ, woilu tɛ a fɔ wa, ko fa le donni ai rɔ? <verse eid="1CO 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 14:24" />Kɔni ni ai bɛɛ ye nabiya kumailu fɔla, lemɛniyabali do wa don ai tɔrɔfɛ, wala mɛn ma a kɔrɔ lɔn, wo kumailu bɛɛ ye a sɔnilu le yirakala a la, bɛɛ ri a kiti. <verse eid="1CO 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 14:25" />A jusu rɔ gbunduilu ri bɔ gbɛma. Wo rɔ, a ri a ɲɔnkin, ka a ɲakɔrɔ bɛn duu ma, ka Alla bato, ka a fɔ ko, «Tuɲa le a ri, Alla ye ai tɛma.»<verse eid="1CO 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ko rabasan lemɛniya jama rɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 14:26" />N badenmailu, ai ye nfen kɛ ai wa ai ladɛn waati mɛn na? Bɛɛ ye na kalaman do ri, wala karan, wala Alla la ko lɛnkɛnɛmaya, wala kan gbɛrɛ do, wala kan natamin. Wo bɛɛ ye kɛ lemɛniya jama sɛɛbɛ don ko ri. <verse eid="1CO 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 14:27" />Ni mɔɔ doilu ye kumala kan gbɛrɛ rɔ, mɔɔ fila wala sawa, woilu bɛɛ ye kuma kelen kelen ɲa ma. Kɔni ii ye mɛn fɔla fɔɔ mɔɔ gbɛrɛ ye wo latamin. <verse eid="1CO 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 14:28" />Ni mɔɔ tɛ ye mɛn di a kɔrɔ fɔ, wo tii ye a makun lemɛniya jama rɔ wo rɔ, kɔni a ye kuma a ni Alla tɛma. <verse eid="1CO 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 14:29" />Keladen fisamanteilu fanan, mɔɔ fila wala sawa mɛnilu ye nabiya kumailu fɔla, woilu ye kuma, doilu ye ii la kumailu fɛsɛfɛsɛ. <verse eid="1CO 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 14:30" />Kɔni ni mɔɔ do siinin ai tɛma ladɛn dɔ, Alla ye ko do yiraka a la, a bɛnnin de, kumala fɔlɔ ye a makun fɔlɔ. <verse eid="1CO 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 14:31" />Baa A bɛnnin de, ai ye nabiya kumailu fɔ kelen kelen ɲa ma kosa ai bɛɛ ye karan sɔrɔn, ka lalemɛniya. <verse eid="1CO 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 14:32" />Keladen fisamanteilu la dinmalifen ye ii la nɔɔ le kɔrɔ, <verse eid="1CO 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 14:33" />baa Alla kɛnin tɛ ko rabasanna Alla ri, kɔni fɔɔ jususuma Alla.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 14:33">A ye wo ɲa le ma mɔɔ sɛnimanilu lemɛniya jama bɛɛ rɔ.<verse eid="1CO 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 14:34" />Musoilu ka kan ka ii makun ladɛn dɔ, ka a masɔrɔn ii ma kan ka kuma, kɔni ii ye ii fanmajii ikomin sariya ka a fɔ ɲa mɛn ma. <verse eid="1CO 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 14:35" />Ni ii ye a fɛ, ka ko do ɲayen, ii ye ii la cɛɛilu maɲininka ii wara. Muso wa kuma ladɛn dɔ, maloya ko le wo ri.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">14.35</char> Tumadɔ muso doilu ye Korɛnti so lemɛniya jama rɔ, mɛnilu dorinin ɲininkali kɛla kawandi bɔ waati rɔ, wo ka kawandili bɔ ten, jama ka kan ka ii tolo malɔ waati mɛn na. Kɔni waati gbɛrɛ musoilu ka kan ka kuma ikomin a kumara ɲa mɛn ma Korɛnti Fɔlɔ suran 11 kuma diya 5 kɔndɔ.</note><verse eid="1CO 14:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 14:36" />Alla la kuma bɔnin ai wara le wa? Wala a nanin aile le kelen ma wa? <verse eid="1CO 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 14:37" />Ni mɔɔ si ka a miri ko keladen fisamante le ale ri wala Alla la Nii Sɛniman na dinmalifen ye a bolo, n ye ko mɛnilu sɛbɛla ai ma, a ka kan ka a lɔn ko Maari la jamariilu le woilu ri. <verse eid="1CO 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 14:38" />Ni a ma kuma ɲin jate, a fanan tɛ a jatela.<verse eid="1CO 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 14:39" />Wo le rɔ, n badenmailu, nabiya kumailu fɔ lɔɔ ye ai mirala. Ai kana tɔn sii kan gbɛrɛ fɔ ko la fanan. <verse eid="1CO 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 14:40" />Kɔni ko bɛɛ ye ɲabɔ koɲuma sila kan.<verse eid="1CO 14:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CO 15" />
  <para style="s">Isa wuli ko saya rɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 15:1" />Nba, n badenmailu, n ye Isa la ko Kibaro Ɲuma la ko labila ai la, n ka mɛn nase ai ma, ai ka a lamira, ai sɛɛbɛ donnin mɛn ma, <verse eid="1CO 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 15:2" />ai kisinin mɛn fɛ, ni ai ka a mira ikomin n ka a lase ai ma ɲa mɛn ma. Ni wo tɛ, ai ra la a la fuu rɔ.<verse eid="1CO 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 15:3" />N ka mɛn sɔrɔn, n da wo lase ai ma ko fɔlɔ ri: Ɲenematɔmɔnin faanin an julumunilu le la ko rɔ, ikomin Kitabu ka a fɔ ɲa mɛn ma. <verse eid="1CO 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 15:4" />A su donda le, a la saya tele sawana lon a wulira ka bɔ saya rɔ, ikomin Kitabu ka a fɔ ɲa mɛn ma. <verse eid="1CO 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 15:5" />A ka a jɛrɛ yiraka Sefasi la, wo kɔ rɔ a la talibidenba tan ni filailu. <verse eid="1CO 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 15:6" />Wo kɔ rɔ, a ka a jɛrɛ yiraka lemɛniya mɔɔ kɛmɛ loolu (500) a ni kɔ la waati kelen dɔ. Wo siyaman ye ii nii la fanan, kɔni do ra faa. <verse eid="1CO 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 15:7" />Wo kɔ rɔ, Yakuba ka a yen, a la talibidenbailu bɛɛ ka a yen ikɔ tuun.<verse eid="1CO 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 15:8" />Tɔɔ la a ka a jɛrɛ yiraka nde fanan na, nde mɛn kɛnin ikomin den mɛn sɔrɔnda a sɔrɔn waati taminnin. <verse eid="1CO 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 15:9" />Baa nde le talibidenba dɔɔmannin di. A ma kan ka fɔ n ma ko «talibidenba,» ka a masɔrɔn n tɛrɛ ra Alla la lemɛniya jama bɛnsɛnkɔnintɛya. <verse eid="1CO 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 15:10" />Kɔni Alla la hina rɔ, a ka n kɛɲa mafalen tende. A ka hina mɛn natɛɛ n ma wo ma kɛ fuu rɔ, ka a tɛrɛn nde baarara le ka tamin talibidenba doilu bɛɛ la. Nde tɛ kɔni Alla la hina le tɛrɛ n fɛ. <verse eid="1CO 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 15:11" />Wo rɔ, ni a kɛra nde ri, ni a kɛra iile ri, an ye ɲin de kawandili kɛla. Ai fanan da la wo la.<verse eid="1CO 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">An wuli ko ka bɔ saya rɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 15:12" />Nba, an ye kawandili kɛla ko Ɲenematɔmɔnin da wuli ka bɔ saya rɔ, aile doilu ri se a fɔla fanan di ko mɔɔ faanin tɛ wulila ka bɔ saya rɔ? <verse eid="1CO 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 15:13" />Ni mɔɔ faanin tɛ wulila ka bɔ saya rɔ, wo rɔ Ɲenematɔmɔnin jɛrɛ fanan ma wuli ka bɔ saya rɔ. <verse eid="1CO 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 15:14" />Nba, ni Ɲenematɔmɔnin ma wuli ka bɔ saya rɔ, kawandili bɔ kun tɛrɛ tɛ wo ri an bolo wo rɔ, ai la lemɛniya fanan di to fuyan. <verse eid="1CO 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 15:15" />Mɛn taminnin wo la, a kɛnin de ko an da wuya fɔla sereya bɔ Alla la ko rɔ wo rɔ, baa an da a fɔ ko a ra a la Mɔɔ Ɲenematɔmɔnin nawuli ka bɔ saya rɔ. Ka a tɛrɛn ni mɔɔ faanin tɛ wulila ka bɔ saya rɔ, wo kɔrɔ le ko Alla ma a fanan nawuli ka bɔ saya rɔ. <verse eid="1CO 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 15:16" />Baa ni mɔɔ faaninilu tɛ wulila ka bɔ saya rɔ, Ɲenematɔmɔnin fanan tɛ wulila ka bɔ saya rɔ wo rɔ. <verse eid="1CO 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 15:17" />Nba, ni Ɲenematɔmɔnin tɛrɛ ma wuli ka bɔ saya rɔ, ai la lemɛniya ra kɛ fuu ri, ai fanan ye ai julumunilu rɔ wo rɔ fɔlɔ. <verse eid="1CO 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 15:18" />Wo kɔrɔ le ko, mɛn tɛrɛ ra lemɛniya Ɲenematɔmɔnin ma, woilu faara, woilu ra tunun wo rɔ. <verse eid="1CO 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 15:19" />Ni an ka an jii la Ɲenematɔmɔnin dɔ an na dunuɲaratɛɛ ɲin de dɔrɔn dɔ, wo rɔ andeilu makininkininnin ka tamin mɔɔilu bɛɛ la.<verse eid="1CO 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 15:20" />Kɔni Ɲenematɔmɔnin da wuli ka bɔ saya rɔ fewu! Mɔɔ fɔlɔ wulinin de a ri ka bɔ saya rɔ, mɔɔ faaninilu tɛma. <verse eid="1CO 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 15:21" />Baa saya nanin mɔɔ do le fɛ, wo ɲa ma, mɔɔilu fanan ye wulila ka bɔ saya rɔ mɔɔ do le fɛ. <verse eid="1CO 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 15:22" />Baa ikomin, mɔɔ bɛɛ ye faala le Adama fɛ, wo ɲa ma, mɔɔ bɛɛ fanan di wuli ka bɔ saya rɔ Ɲenematɔmɔnin fɛ. <verse eid="1CO 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 15:23" />Kɔni mɔɔ bɛɛ ni a la waati lanin de, Ɲenematɔmɔnin de mɔɔ fɔlɔ ri mɛn wulira ka bɔ saya rɔ. Wo kɔ rɔ, a la mɔɔilu fanan di wuli ka bɔ saya rɔ a na waati rɔ. <verse eid="1CO 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 15:24" />Wo wa tamin, a laban wa se, Isa ri na mansayailu ni se tiiya ni fankamailu bɛɛ tiɲan, ka mansaya don a Fa Alla bolo. <verse eid="1CO 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 15:25" />Baa a fɛrɛ tɛ ye fɔɔ Isa ye mansaya kɛ le haan Alla ye a juuilu bɛɛ la a sen kɔrɔ waati mɛn na. <verse eid="1CO 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 15:26" />Juu mɛn ye halakila tɔɔ la, wo le saya ri. <verse eid="1CO 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 15:27" />Baa Kitabu ra a fɔ ko, «A ra fen bɛɛ la a sen kɔrɔ.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">15.27</char> Yaburi suran 110 kuma diya 1</note> Kɔni a ka a fɔnin ko fen bɛɛ ra la a sen kɔrɔ, wo gbɛnin ko Alla tɛ woilu rɔ mɛn ka fen bɛɛ la ale sen kɔrɔ. <verse eid="1CO 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 15:28" />Fen bɛɛ wa la a sen kɔrɔ, wo rɔ ale jɛrɛ, Alla Dencɛ fanan di la Alla sen kɔrɔ mɛn ka fen bɛɛ la a sen kɔrɔ, kosa Alla ye to fen bɛɛ kun na ko bɛɛ rɔ.<verse eid="1CO 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 15:29" />Ni wo ɲa tɛ, mɔɔ mɛnilu sunnin ji rɔ mɔɔ faaninilu la ko rɔ woilu ye nfen ɲininna? Ni mɔɔ faaninilu tɛ wulila ka bɔ saya rɔ muumɛ, nfenna mɔɔilu ye sunna ji rɔ woilu la ko rɔ? <verse eid="1CO 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 15:30" />Andeilu fanan, nfenna andeilu ye gbalo da kɔrɔ yan waati bɛɛ? <verse eid="1CO 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 15:31" />N badenmailu, n ye saya da kɔrɔ lon lon. N ye n jɛrɛmatɔɔla ai la ko rɔ baa ai tonin Maari Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin fɛ, n da n kali wo le la, tuɲa le a ri. <verse eid="1CO 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 15:32" />Ni n ka dalifen jamanniilu kɛlɛ Ɛfɛsi so kɔndɔ adamadenilu la koilu le dɔrɔn dɔ, wo munanfan ɲuman tɛrɛ n ma wo rɔ? Ni mɔɔ faaninilu tɛrɛ tɛ wulila ka bɔ saya rɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 15:32">«An ye dɔɔnnin kɛ, ka an min</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 15:32">baa an di sa sini.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">15.32</char> Esayi suran 22 kuma diya 13</note><verse eid="1CO 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 15:33" />Do kana ai majuuwaya ka a masɔrɔn, «Teri juuilu ye sɔn ɲuma tiɲanna le.» <verse eid="1CO 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 15:34" />Ai ye hankili sɔrɔn fanan ikomin a dahanin ɲa mɛn ma, ka ai la hakɛ koilu lalɔ. Baa aile do ma Alla lɔn, n ye ɲin fɔla ai la maloya le ma.<verse eid="1CO 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Faribanku wuli ko ka bɔ saya rɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 15:35" />Do ri ɲininkali kɛ ko, «Mɔɔ faaninilu ye wulila ka bɔ saya rɔ di? Ii ye nala faribanku su ɲuman dɔ?» <verse eid="1CO 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 15:36" />Hankilidɔɔ! I wa si foyi i la sɛnɛ rɔ waati mɛn na, a tɛ fɛrɛn na a ma sa fɔlɔ. <verse eid="1CO 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 15:37" />I tɛ si ju foyila kɔni fɔɔ a kisɛ dɔrɔn, binbiriba wala lannifen gbɛrɛ. <verse eid="1CO 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 15:38" />Kɔni Alla le si lafɛrɛnna a ju ri bonya ikomin a duman a yɛ ɲa mɛn ma. Ale le si su bɛɛ ju kɛɲa latɛɛla a ma.<verse eid="1CO 15:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 15:39" />Nimafen bɛɛ fari tɛ kelen di. Mɔɔ fari ye a danna, sobo fari ye a danna, kɔnɔ fari ye a danna, jɛɛ fari ye a danna. <verse eid="1CO 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 15:40" />Sankolo fariilu ye ye, dunuɲa fariilu ye ye. Sankolo fariilu nɔɔrɔ ye a danna, dunuɲa fariilu nɔɔrɔ ye a danna. <verse eid="1CO 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CO 15:41" />Tele nɔɔrɔ ye a danna, karo nɔɔrɔ ye a danna, loloilu fanan nɔɔrɔ ye ii danna, lolo kelen kelen bɛɛ nɔɔrɔ ye a danna.<verse eid="1CO 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CO 15:42" />Mɔɔ faaninilu wa wuli ka bɔ saya rɔ, a ye kɛla wo ɲa le ma. Faribanku mɛn ye sudonna, a ri se tiɲanna. Kɔni a wa wuli mɔɔ faaniilu tɛma, a ti se tiɲanna. <verse eid="1CO 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CO 15:43" />A ye donna waati mɛn na, a lafɛyanin, fanka tɛ a la. Kɔni a wa wuli, a nɔɔrɔnin, fanka ye a la kosɛbɛ! <verse eid="1CO 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CO 15:44" />A ye donna waati mɛn na, faribanku le tɛrɛ a ri, a wa wuli, harijeene fari le wo ri. Ni faribanku ye ye, harijeene fari fanan ye ye. <verse eid="1CO 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CO 15:45" />Wo le rɔ, a sɛbɛnin Kitabu kɔndɔ tende ko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 15:45">«Adama, Alla la mɔɔ dannin fɔlɔ kɛra niilama le ri.»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CO 15:45">Kɔni Adama tɔɔ laban,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">15.45</char> Adama fɔlɔman ko yenna A Damira suran 2 kuma diya 7 kɔndɔ. <char style="fk">Adama tɔɔ laban</char>, wo kɛnin Isa le ri.</note> wo kɛra nii ri mɛn ye niimaya dila. <verse eid="1CO 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CO 15:46" />Harijeene fari ɲin fɔlɔ ma na fɔɔ faribanku, wo kɔ rɔ, harijeene fari nara. <verse eid="1CO 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CO 15:47" />Adamaden fɔlɔ, Alla ka wo dan duu ɲin banku le la. Adamaden filana, wo bɔnin harijeene le rɔ. <verse eid="1CO 15:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CO 15:48" />Mɛn dannin banku ɲin dɔ, dunuɲa mɔɔilu ye wo le munuɲa ri. Mɔɔ mɛn bɔnin harijeene, harijeene mɔɔilu ye wo le munuɲa ri. <verse eid="1CO 15:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CO 15:49" />An da munuɲa adamaden na mɛn bɔnin banku rɔ, an natɔ munuɲala wo ɲa le ma harijeene mɔɔ la.<verse eid="1CO 15:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CO 15:50" />N badenmailu, n ye mɛn ma, wo le ɲin di ko mɛn dannin faribanku ni jeli la, ii ti se Alla la mansaya sɔrɔnna. Fen mɛn ye tiɲanna, wo ti cɛ tiɲanbali sɔrɔnna.<verse eid="1CO 15:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CO 15:51" />Ai ye ai tolo malɔ, n ye gbundu ko le fɔla. An bɛɛ ti nala faala, kɔni an bɛɛ ri yɛlɛman. <verse eid="1CO 15:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CO 15:52" />Baa buru tɔɔ laban wa fɛ waati mɛn na, mɔɔ faaninilu ri wuli ka bɔ saya rɔ, ka habadan niilakisi sɔrɔn, an bɛɛ ri yɛlɛman jonna sani ɲa makadi. <verse eid="1CO 15:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CO 15:53" />Baa an faribanku mɛn ye tiɲanna, a fɛrɛ tɛ ye fɔɔ a ye yɛlɛman fari ri mɛn tɛ tiɲanna. Mɛn ye faala wo ye yɛlɛman faabali ri. <verse eid="1CO 15:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CO 15:54" />Wo le rɔ, an fari mɛn ye tiɲanna, a wa yɛlɛman fari tiɲanbali ri waati mɛn na, a ni faata ye yɛlɛman faabali ri, wo wa kɛ, Kitabu la kuma ri dafa wo rɔ ko, «Saya ra halaki fanka sɔrɔn dɔ.»<verse eid="1CO 15:54" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CO 15:55" />«Saya, i fanka ye min?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 15:55">Saya, i mɔɔ faa fanka ye min?»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">15.55</char> A ragbɛ Esayi suran 25 kuma diya 8 ni Hoseya suran 13 kuma diya 14 kɔndɔ.</note><verse eid="1CO 15:55" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CO 15:56" />Saya mɔɔ faa fanka le julumun di, julumun fanan fanka le sariya ri. <verse eid="1CO 15:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CO 15:57" />Kɔni baraka ye bila Alla yɛ mɛn ka fanka sɔrɔn di an ma a la Mɔɔ Ɲenematɔmɔnin baraka rɔ an Maari Isa.<verse eid="1CO 15:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CO 15:58" />Wo le rɔ, n diyanan badenmailu, ai ye ai sɛɛbɛ don kosɛbɛ! Ai kana lamaa. Ai ye to baarala Maari yɛ waati bɛɛ ka a masɔrɔn ai ka a lɔn ko ai ye baara mɛn kɛla Maari yɛ, ko fuu tɛ wo ri muumɛ!<verse eid="1CO 15:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CO 16" />
  <para style="s">Bolo ladɛn Jerusalɛmu lemɛniya mɔɔilu yɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 16:1" />Ai ka mɛn sɛbɛ bolo ladɛn na ko rɔ ka bɛn jama sɛniman na ko ma, an ye na wo ma. Ai ye kɛ ikomin n ka jamarili mɛn di Kalati jamana lemɛniya jama ladɛnilu ma. <verse eid="1CO 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 16:2" />Lahadi lahadi, ai kelen kelenna bɛɛ ye wodi do lamara a danna ai wara, ka bɛn ai la sɔrɔnninya jate ma, kosa ai kana n makɔnɔn ai la bolo ladɛn ko rɔ. <verse eid="1CO 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 16:3" />N wa na waati mɛn na, ai wa mɔɔ mɛnilu suwandi, n di woilu lawa jamarili bataki ye ii bolo, ka ai la dinmalifenilu lawa Jerusalɛmu so kɔndɔ. <verse eid="1CO 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 16:4" />Kɔni ni a bɛnnin nde jɛrɛ ye wa, fɔɔ an bɛɛ ye wa wo rɔ.<verse eid="1CO 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔli la baarailu la ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 16:5" />N wa tamin Masedoni jamana rɔ waati mɛn na, n di wa ai wara, baa n di tamin ye. <verse eid="1CO 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 16:6" />Tumado n di waati dɔndɔ kɛ ai wara, wala nɛnɛ waati bɛɛ. Wo rɔ, ai ri n fanda n na taama rɔ n wa kɛ taala yɔrɔ mɛn. <verse eid="1CO 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 16:7" />N tɛ a fɛ, ka ai yen gbansan, ka tamin. N ye a fɛ le ka waatinin kɛ ai wara, ni Maari sɔnda. <verse eid="1CO 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 16:8" />Kɔni n di to Ɛfɛsi so kɔndɔ haan Dabondɛ Sali lon, <verse eid="1CO 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 16:9" />ka a masɔrɔn da ba ra laka n yɛ ka baara bɛrɛ kɛ, wo ni n kɛlɛkɛɲɔɔilu ka siya.<verse eid="1CO 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 16:10" />Ni Timote nara, ai ye a ramira kosa silan si kana a mira, baa a ye baarala Maari le yɛ ikomin nde. <verse eid="1CO 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 16:11" />Wo rɔ, mɔɔ si kana a lagboyaɲɛ. Kɔni ai ye a fanda a la taama rɔ jususuma rɔ, kosa a ye a kɔsɛ n tɔrɔfɛ ikɔ tuun, n ye a ni an badenma doilu makɔnɔnna yan.<verse eid="1CO 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 16:12" />Ai ka mɛn sɛbɛ an badenma Apɔlɔsi la ko rɔ, an ye na wo ma. N da a madiya haan kosa a ye wa ai wara a ni badenma doilu, kɔni a ɲɛnikɛ tɛrɛ tɛ a ri ka wo kɛ fɔlɔ. Ni a ka fɛrɛ sɔrɔn, a ri wa.<verse eid="1CO 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jamarili labanilu ni tuwaliilu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 16:13" />Ai ye to ai ɲana, ka to lemɛniya rɔ gben gben. Ai ye ai wakila, ka fanka sɔrɔn. <verse eid="1CO 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 16:14" />Ai ye ko bɛɛ kɛ kaninteya rɔ.<verse eid="1CO 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 16:15" />Ai ka a lɔn ko Esitefana ni a la denbaya le fɔlɔ tubira Isa ma Akaya jamana rɔ, ii ka ii jɛrɛ to jama sɛnimanna baara la. N badenmailu, n ye ai madiyala, <verse eid="1CO 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 16:16" />ai ye kolo wo mɔɔ suilu ma, a ni mɛnilu bɛɛ ye ii kologbɛlɛyala baara ɲin dɔ.<verse eid="1CO 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 16:17" />N da sɛwa Esitefana na ko la, a ni Foritunatusi ni Akayikusu. Baa ai tɛrɛ tɛ yan, mɛn dɛsɛnin tɛrɛ n ma ii ka wo don de n bolo ai nɔ rɔ. <verse eid="1CO 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 16:18" />Ii ra n nii ladiya n ma ikomin ii ka ai nii ladiya ai ma ɲa mɛn ma. Ai ye wo mɔɔ suilu gbiliya.<verse eid="1CO 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 16:19" />Asi jamana lemɛniya jamailu ye ai tuwala. Akila ni Pirisili ni lemɛniya jama mɛnilu ye ii ladɛnna ii la bon kɔndɔ, woilu ye ai tuwala Maari tɔɔ rɔ kosɛbɛ! <verse eid="1CO 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 16:20" />Lemɛniya mɔɔ mɛnilu bɛɛ ye yan, woilu ye ai tuwala. Ai ye ai ɲɔɔn tuwa badenmaya tuwali sunbuli rɔ.<verse eid="1CO 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 16:21" />Nde Pɔli le tuwali kan ɲin sɛbɛla n bolo la.<verse eid="1CO 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 16:22" />Mɛn tɛ Maari kaninna, wo ye danka.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 16:22">«An Maari, na jonna!» <verse eid="1CO 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 16:23" />An Maari Isa la hina ye to ai fɛ. <verse eid="1CO 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 16:24" />N na kaninteya ye ai bɛɛ yɛ Ɲenematɔmɔnin Isa baraka rɔ.<verse eid="1CO 16:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 16" />
</usx>